window.ESSAY_BOOK = {"sourceFile":"成都市初三英语Unit1-8范文集.tex","generatedAt":"2026-10-18","title":"成都市初三英语书面表达范文集","subtitle":"人教版新课纲版九年级上册 Unit 1 — Unit 8","stats":{"units":8,"essays":80,"patterns":64,"groupA":40,"groupB":40},"units":[{"no":1,"enName":"The Changing World","cnName":"变化中的世界","grammar":"一般过去时 vs 现在完成时；used to do sth","task":"Changes in My Life（我生活的变化）","patterns":[{"en":"I used to be afraid of speaking in class.","cn":"我过去害怕在课堂上发言。","usage":"used to do 表示过去的习惯或状态，暗示“现在已经不再这样”。","search":"i used to be afraid of speaking in class. 我过去害怕在课堂上发言。 used to do 表示过去的习惯或状态，暗示“现在已经不再这样”。"},{"en":"There used to be a small river near my home.","cn":"我家附近过去有一条小河。","usage":"There used to be 表示过去存在的事物，常用于描写家乡的环境变化。","search":"there used to be a small river near my home. 我家附近过去有一条小河。 there used to be 表示过去存在的事物，常用于描写家乡的环境变化。"},{"en":"Great changes have taken place in my hometown.","cn":"我的家乡发生了巨大的变化。","usage":"现在完成时强调变化已经发生，是“变化类”作文的万能开头句。","search":"great changes have taken place in my hometown. 我的家乡发生了巨大的变化。 现在完成时强调变化已经发生，是“变化类”作文的万能开头句。"},{"en":"Our life has become better and better.","cn":"我们的生活变得越来越好。","usage":"现在完成时与“比较级 + and + 比较级”连用，表达持续向好的变化。","search":"our life has become better and better. 我们的生活变得越来越好。 现在完成时与“比较级 + and + 比较级”连用，表达持续向好的变化。"},{"en":"In the past, the streets were narrow and dirty.","cn":"过去，街道又窄又脏。","usage":"一般过去时描写过去的状况，与对现在的描写形成今昔对比。","search":"in the past, the streets were narrow and dirty. 过去，街道又窄又脏。 一般过去时描写过去的状况，与对现在的描写形成今昔对比。"},{"en":"Chengdu is no longer what it used to be.","cn":"成都已不再是过去的样子了。","usage":"what it used to be 表示“过去的样子”，用于总述一座城市的变化。","search":"chengdu is no longer what it used to be. 成都已不再是过去的样子了。 what it used to be 表示“过去的样子”，用于总述一座城市的变化。"},{"en":"Compared with the past, life is much more convenient now.","cn":"与过去相比，现在的生活方便多了。","usage":"Compared with... 引出今昔对比，是写作中的高频表达。","search":"compared with the past, life is much more convenient now. 与过去相比，现在的生活方便多了。 compared with... 引出今昔对比，是写作中的高频表达。"},{"en":"I have lived in Chengdu for ten years.","cn":"我已经在成都住了十年。","usage":"现在完成时与 for 连用，表示从过去一直持续到现在的状态。","search":"i have lived in chengdu for ten years. 我已经在成都住了十年。 现在完成时与 for 连用，表示从过去一直持续到现在的状态。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u1-a1","unit":1,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"我生活的变化","enTitle":"Changes in My Life","words":"约126词","wordsApprox":126,"paragraphs":["Great changes have taken place in my life over the past few years. I used to spend most of my free time watching TV, which made me forget my homework. Now, I have developed a habit of reading and exercising. I often go jogging along the Tianfu Greenway, which is famous for its beautiful views.","What's more, my family used to live in a small apartment, but now we live in a bright new one. Life has become so convenient that I can do many things with a smartphone. Not only has my life become more colorful, but I have also become more confident. I believe these changes have taught me to value every day. I will keep working hard to make my life even better."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用现在完成时 Great changes have taken place 总起全篇，直接点题；2）used to spend... watching TV 与 now 形成鲜明对比，两个 which 引导的非限制性定语从句让叙述更加地道流畅；3）结尾 Not only has my life become more colorful, but I have also become more confident. 使用倒装结构，句式高级且表意自然，升华“变化让我成长”的主题。","highlight":"Not only has my life become more colorful, but I have also become more confident.","highlightCn":"我的生活不仅变得更加丰富多彩，我自己也变得更加自信。"},"translation":null,"search":"我生活的变化 changes in my life great changes have taken place in my life over the past few years. i used to spend most of my free time watching tv, which made me forget my homework. now, i have developed a habit of reading and exercising. i often go jogging along the tianfu greenway, which is famous for its beautiful views. what's more, my family used to live in a small apartment, but now we live in a bright new one. life has become so convenient that i can do many things with a smartphone. not only has my life become more colorful, but i have also become more confident. i believe these changes have taught me to value every day. i will keep working hard to make my life even better. 1）开篇用现在完成时 great changes have taken place 总起全篇，直接点题；2）used to spend... watching tv 与 now 形成鲜明对比，两个 which 引导的非限制性定语从句让叙述更加地道流畅；3）结尾 not only has my life become more colorful, but i have also become more confident. 使用倒装结构，句式高级且表意自然，升华“变化让我成长”的主题。 not only has my life become more colorful, but i have also become more confident. 我的生活不仅变得更加丰富多彩，我自己也变得更加自信。"},{"id":"u1-a2","unit":1,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"家乡成都的变化","enTitle":"Changes in My Hometown","words":"约137词","wordsApprox":137,"paragraphs":["Chengdu, my hometown, has changed a lot over the past ten years. I still remember the narrow streets that were full of people and old bikes. At that time, few people could imagine the changes that were coming. The city has built a large metro network, so people can travel to almost every corner of the city quickly. Wide roads have taken the place of small paths, and high buildings have risen where low houses once stood.","Moreover, Chengdu has become a famous “Park City”. The Tianfu Greenway, which stretches across the whole city, offers people a wonderful place to exercise and relax. Not only is the environment much better now, but people's lives are also much more convenient. I am proud of my hometown and I believe it will become even more beautiful in the future."],"analysis":{"text":"1）两处定语从句 that were full of...、that were coming 描写旧时街道，画面感强；2）Wide roads have taken the place of small paths 与 high buildings have risen where low houses once stood 用 take the place of、rise 两个动词生动呈现新旧更替，where 引导地点状语从句；3）Not only is the environment... but people's lives are also... 倒装结构提升句式层次，结尾 I am proud of 升华情感。","highlight":"High buildings have risen where low houses once stood.","highlightCn":"高楼大厦在昔日低矮房屋所在的地方拔地而起。"},"translation":null,"search":"家乡成都的变化 changes in my hometown chengdu, my hometown, has changed a lot over the past ten years. i still remember the narrow streets that were full of people and old bikes. at that time, few people could imagine the changes that were coming. the city has built a large metro network, so people can travel to almost every corner of the city quickly. wide roads have taken the place of small paths, and high buildings have risen where low houses once stood. moreover, chengdu has become a famous “park city”. the tianfu greenway, which stretches across the whole city, offers people a wonderful place to exercise and relax. not only is the environment much better now, but people's lives are also much more convenient. i am proud of my hometown and i believe it will become even more beautiful in the future. 1）两处定语从句 that were full of...、that were coming 描写旧时街道，画面感强；2）wide roads have taken the place of small paths 与 high buildings have risen where low houses once stood 用 take the place of、rise 两个动词生动呈现新旧更替，where 引导地点状语从句；3）not only is the environment... but people's lives are also... 倒装结构提升句式层次，结尾 i am proud of 升华情感。 high buildings have risen where low houses once stood. 高楼大厦在昔日低矮房屋所在的地方拔地而起。"},{"id":"u1-a3","unit":1,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"给外国笔友的信：介绍成都的变化","enTitle":"A Letter About the Changes in Chengdu","words":"约140词","wordsApprox":140,"paragraphs":["Dear Tom,","How is everything going? I'm glad to tell you that great changes have taken place in Chengdu, my hometown.","Chengdu used to be a city of low houses and narrow streets. But now it has become a modern “Park City”. The metro network has made traveling so convenient that you can reach almost everywhere in the city quickly. What's more, the Tianfu Greenway, which is loved by people of all ages, offers a wonderful place for running and cycling. Not only has the environment become cleaner, but the city has also built more parks and wide roads. Last week I rode along the Greenway with my parents, and I was amazed by the beautiful views.","I hope you can come and see the new Chengdu yourself. I'm sure you will fall in love with it.","Yours,","Li Hua"],"analysis":{"text":"1）书信格式完整规范，开头 How is everything going? 符合笔友通信的语气，结尾自然收束；2）used to be 与 has become 形成今昔对比，so...that... 与 which 非限制性定语从句并用，表达丰富地道；3）插入 Last week I rode along the Greenway with my parents 这一亲身经历，用一般过去时写具体事例，增强真实感和说服力。","highlight":"The metro network has made traveling so convenient that you can reach almost everywhere in the city quickly.","highlightCn":"地铁网络让出行变得如此便捷，你可以很快到达这座城市的几乎任何地方。"},"translation":null,"search":"给外国笔友的信：介绍成都的变化 a letter about the changes in chengdu dear tom, how is everything going? i'm glad to tell you that great changes have taken place in chengdu, my hometown. chengdu used to be a city of low houses and narrow streets. but now it has become a modern “park city”. the metro network has made traveling so convenient that you can reach almost everywhere in the city quickly. what's more, the tianfu greenway, which is loved by people of all ages, offers a wonderful place for running and cycling. not only has the environment become cleaner, but the city has also built more parks and wide roads. last week i rode along the greenway with my parents, and i was amazed by the beautiful views. i hope you can come and see the new chengdu yourself. i'm sure you will fall in love with it. yours, li hua 1）书信格式完整规范，开头 how is everything going? 符合笔友通信的语气，结尾自然收束；2）used to be 与 has become 形成今昔对比，so...that... 与 which 非限制性定语从句并用，表达丰富地道；3）插入 last week i rode along the greenway with my parents 这一亲身经历，用一般过去时写具体事例，增强真实感和说服力。 the metro network has made traveling so convenient that you can reach almost everywhere in the city quickly. 地铁网络让出行变得如此便捷，你可以很快到达这座城市的几乎任何地方。"},{"id":"u1-a4","unit":1,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"过去与现在的我","enTitle":"How I Have Changed","words":"约144词","wordsApprox":144,"paragraphs":["Looking back at the past three years, I find that I have changed a lot, not only in appearance but also in personality.","I used to be a quiet and shy boy. When teachers asked questions, I never raised my hand because I was afraid of making mistakes. However, now I have become confident and outgoing. I often join in class discussions and share my ideas with others. I used to hate sports, but now I have fallen in love with running. Every weekend, I go running with my father along the Tianfu Greenway, which makes me healthy and energetic. What's more, I have made great progress in my study. I have developed good learning habits, so my grades have improved a lot.","These changes have taught me an important lesson: as long as we try our best, we can become better and better."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用非谓语动词 Looking back at... 引出回忆，not only...but also... 概括变化维度；2）两处 used to... but now... 对比性格与爱好，一般过去时 never raised my hand 与现在完成时 have fallen in love with 切换准确；3）which makes me healthy and energetic 定语从句自然衔接，结尾 as long as 条件句点出变化带来的成长感悟。","highlight":"I used to hate sports, but now I have fallen in love with running.","highlightCn":"我过去讨厌运动，但现在我已经爱上了跑步。"},"translation":null,"search":"过去与现在的我 how i have changed looking back at the past three years, i find that i have changed a lot, not only in appearance but also in personality. i used to be a quiet and shy boy. when teachers asked questions, i never raised my hand because i was afraid of making mistakes. however, now i have become confident and outgoing. i often join in class discussions and share my ideas with others. i used to hate sports, but now i have fallen in love with running. every weekend, i go running with my father along the tianfu greenway, which makes me healthy and energetic. what's more, i have made great progress in my study. i have developed good learning habits, so my grades have improved a lot. these changes have taught me an important lesson: as long as we try our best, we can become better and better. 1）开头用非谓语动词 looking back at... 引出回忆，not only...but also... 概括变化维度；2）两处 used to... but now... 对比性格与爱好，一般过去时 never raised my hand 与现在完成时 have fallen in love with 切换准确；3）which makes me healthy and energetic 定语从句自然衔接，结尾 as long as 条件句点出变化带来的成长感悟。 i used to hate sports, but now i have fallen in love with running. 我过去讨厌运动，但现在我已经爱上了跑步。"},{"id":"u1-a5","unit":1,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"环境的变化与我们的行动","enTitle":"Changes in the Environment and What We Can Do","words":"约142词","wordsApprox":142,"paragraphs":["The environment has changed greatly in recent years. In the past, some rivers were so dirty that fish could not live in them, and many people used to throw rubbish everywhere. However, great changes have taken place. The water has become cleaner, the streets are much tidier, and trees have been planted along the wide roads. Chengdu is now praised as a “Park City”, and the Tianfu Greenway has become a popular place for walking and cycling.","These changes did not happen by themselves. Not only has the government worked hard to protect the environment, but ordinary people like us have also taken action. We have learned to sort rubbish and use public transport more often.","The environment is our home. I believe that as long as everyone plays a part, our city will become an even better place to live in."],"analysis":{"text":"1）过去用 so dirty that... 与 used to throw rubbish 描写环境问题，现在完成时 have taken place、has become 呈现变化成果，对比鲜明；2）These changes did not happen by themselves. 独立成段、短句有力，not only...but also... 倒装结构引出政府与个人的共同努力；3）结尾 as long as 条件句发出倡议，everyone plays a part 呼应单元话题，主题升华。","highlight":"Not only has the government worked hard to protect the environment, but ordinary people like us have also taken action.","highlightCn":"不仅政府努力保护环境，像我们这样的普通人也已经行动起来。"},"translation":null,"search":"环境的变化与我们的行动 changes in the environment and what we can do the environment has changed greatly in recent years. in the past, some rivers were so dirty that fish could not live in them, and many people used to throw rubbish everywhere. however, great changes have taken place. the water has become cleaner, the streets are much tidier, and trees have been planted along the wide roads. chengdu is now praised as a “park city”, and the tianfu greenway has become a popular place for walking and cycling. these changes did not happen by themselves. not only has the government worked hard to protect the environment, but ordinary people like us have also taken action. we have learned to sort rubbish and use public transport more often. the environment is our home. i believe that as long as everyone plays a part, our city will become an even better place to live in. 1）过去用 so dirty that... 与 used to throw rubbish 描写环境问题，现在完成时 have taken place、has become 呈现变化成果，对比鲜明；2）these changes did not happen by themselves. 独立成段、短句有力，not only...but also... 倒装结构引出政府与个人的共同努力；3）结尾 as long as 条件句发出倡议，everyone plays a part 呼应单元话题，主题升华。 not only has the government worked hard to protect the environment, but ordinary people like us have also taken action. 不仅政府努力保护环境，像我们这样的普通人也已经行动起来。"},{"id":"u1-b1","unit":1,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"我的变化","enTitle":"My Changes","words":"约87词","wordsApprox":87,"paragraphs":["I have changed a lot in the past three years. Now let me tell you about my changes.","First, I used to be short, but now I am much taller than before. Second, I used to be shy and quiet, but now I like talking with my classmates. Finally, I used to dislike reading, but now I read books for half an hour every day.","I think these changes are good for me. I am very happy about them, and I want to become better and better."],"analysis":null,"translation":"在过去的三年里，我变化很大。现在让我告诉你我的变化。首先，我过去个子矮，但现在我比以前高多了。其次，我过去害羞又安静，但现在我喜欢和同学们聊天。最后，我过去不喜欢读书，但现在我每天读半小时书。我认为这些变化对我有好处。我对这些变化感到非常高兴，我想变得越来越好。","search":"我的变化 my changes i have changed a lot in the past three years. now let me tell you about my changes. first, i used to be short, but now i am much taller than before. second, i used to be shy and quiet, but now i like talking with my classmates. finally, i used to dislike reading, but now i read books for half an hour every day. i think these changes are good for me. i am very happy about them, and i want to become better and better. 在过去的三年里，我变化很大。现在让我告诉你我的变化。首先，我过去个子矮，但现在我比以前高多了。其次，我过去害羞又安静，但现在我喜欢和同学们聊天。最后，我过去不喜欢读书，但现在我每天读半小时书。我认为这些变化对我有好处。我对这些变化感到非常高兴，我想变得越来越好。"},{"id":"u1-b2","unit":1,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"我们家乡的变化","enTitle":"Our Hometown Has Changed","words":"约88词","wordsApprox":88,"paragraphs":["Our hometown Chengdu has changed a lot in recent years. Now let me tell you about the changes.","First, the roads used to be narrow, but now they are wide and clean. Second, there used to be only a few buses, but now the metro network can take us to many places. Finally, people used to live in low houses, but now many people live in tall buildings.","I believe our hometown is becoming more and more beautiful. I love my hometown, and I am proud of it."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我们的家乡成都在最近几年变化很大。现在让我告诉你这些变化。首先，马路过去很窄，但现在又宽又干净。其次，过去只有几辆公交车，但现在地铁网络可以带我们去很多地方。最后，人们过去住在低矮的房子里，但现在很多人住在高楼大厦里。我相信我们的家乡正变得越来越美丽。我爱我的家乡，我为它感到骄傲。","search":"我们家乡的变化 our hometown has changed our hometown chengdu has changed a lot in recent years. now let me tell you about the changes. first, the roads used to be narrow, but now they are wide and clean. second, there used to be only a few buses, but now the metro network can take us to many places. finally, people used to live in low houses, but now many people live in tall buildings. i believe our hometown is becoming more and more beautiful. i love my hometown, and i am proud of it. 我们的家乡成都在最近几年变化很大。现在让我告诉你这些变化。首先，马路过去很窄，但现在又宽又干净。其次，过去只有几辆公交车，但现在地铁网络可以带我们去很多地方。最后，人们过去住在低矮的房子里，但现在很多人住在高楼大厦里。我相信我们的家乡正变得越来越美丽。我爱我的家乡，我为它感到骄傲。"},{"id":"u1-b3","unit":1,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"过去和现在的我","enTitle":"My Past and Now","words":"约86词","wordsApprox":86,"paragraphs":["Everyone changes with time. I have changed a lot in the past few years.","First, I used to get up late, but now I get up early to read English. Second, I used to watch TV for a long time, but now I do sports after school. Finally, I used to be afraid of speaking in class, but now I put up my hand and answer questions.","I think I am much better than before. I am happy with these changes, and I will keep them."],"analysis":null,"translation":"每个人都会随着时间而变化。在过去的几年里，我变化很大。首先，我过去起床很晚，但现在我早起读英语。其次，我过去看电视看很长时间，但现在我放学后做运动。最后，我过去害怕在课堂上发言，但现在我举手回答问题。我认为我比以前好多了。我对这些变化感到高兴，我会保持下去。","search":"过去和现在的我 my past and now everyone changes with time. i have changed a lot in the past few years. first, i used to get up late, but now i get up early to read english. second, i used to watch tv for a long time, but now i do sports after school. finally, i used to be afraid of speaking in class, but now i put up my hand and answer questions. i think i am much better than before. i am happy with these changes, and i will keep them. 每个人都会随着时间而变化。在过去的几年里，我变化很大。首先，我过去起床很晚，但现在我早起读英语。其次，我过去看电视看很长时间，但现在我放学后做运动。最后，我过去害怕在课堂上发言，但现在我举手回答问题。我认为我比以前好多了。我对这些变化感到高兴，我会保持下去。"},{"id":"u1-b4","unit":1,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"我们学校的变化","enTitle":"Changes in My School","words":"约95词","wordsApprox":95,"paragraphs":["My school has changed a lot in the past few years. It is much better now.","First, our classrooms used to be old and dark, but now they are bright and clean. Every classroom has a big screen now. Second, the playground used to be small, but now it is large and beautiful. We can run and play there happily. Finally, we used to have few books in the library, but now we can read all kinds of books.","I believe our school life will be better and better. I love my school very much."],"analysis":null,"translation":"在过去的几年里，我的学校变化很大。它现在好多了。首先，我们的教室过去又旧又暗，但现在又明亮又干净。现在每间教室都有一块大屏幕。其次，操场过去很小，但现在又大又漂亮。我们可以在那里开心地奔跑、玩耍。最后，我们图书馆过去的书很少，但现在我们可以读到各种各样的书。我相信我们的学校生活会越来越好。我非常爱我的学校。","search":"我们学校的变化 changes in my school my school has changed a lot in the past few years. it is much better now. first, our classrooms used to be old and dark, but now they are bright and clean. every classroom has a big screen now. second, the playground used to be small, but now it is large and beautiful. we can run and play there happily. finally, we used to have few books in the library, but now we can read all kinds of books. i believe our school life will be better and better. i love my school very much. 在过去的几年里，我的学校变化很大。它现在好多了。首先，我们的教室过去又旧又暗，但现在又明亮又干净。现在每间教室都有一块大屏幕。其次，操场过去很小，但现在又大又漂亮。我们可以在那里开心地奔跑、玩耍。最后，我们图书馆过去的书很少，但现在我们可以读到各种各样的书。我相信我们的学校生活会越来越好。我非常爱我的学校。"},{"id":"u1-b5","unit":1,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"我家的变化","enTitle":"Changes in My Family","words":"约93词","wordsApprox":93,"paragraphs":["My family has changed a lot in the past few years. Our life is much better now.","First, we used to live in a small old house, but now we live in a big new apartment. Second, my father used to ride a bike to work, but now he takes the metro. It is fast and convenient. Finally, we used to eat simple food, but now we have all kinds of food every day.","I think our life is becoming better and better. I love my family, and I am happy every day."],"analysis":null,"translation":"在过去的几年里，我的家变化很大。我们现在的生活好多了。首先，我们过去住在一间又小又旧的房子里，但现在我们住在一套又大又新的公寓里。其次，我爸爸过去骑自行车上班，但现在他坐地铁。地铁又快又方便。最后，我们过去吃得简单，但现在我们每天有各种各样的食物。我认为我们的生活正变得越来越好。我爱我的家，我每天都很开心。","search":"我家的变化 changes in my family my family has changed a lot in the past few years. our life is much better now. first, we used to live in a small old house, but now we live in a big new apartment. second, my father used to ride a bike to work, but now he takes the metro. it is fast and convenient. finally, we used to eat simple food, but now we have all kinds of food every day. i think our life is becoming better and better. i love my family, and i am happy every day. 在过去的几年里，我的家变化很大。我们现在的生活好多了。首先，我们过去住在一间又小又旧的房子里，但现在我们住在一套又大又新的公寓里。其次，我爸爸过去骑自行车上班，但现在他坐地铁。地铁又快又方便。最后，我们过去吃得简单，但现在我们每天有各种各样的食物。我认为我们的生活正变得越来越好。我爱我的家，我每天都很开心。"}]},{"no":2,"enName":"Inspiring People","cnName":"鼓舞人心的人","grammar":"It is + adj. + (for / of sb.) + to do sth","task":"An Inspiring Person（一位激励我的人）","patterns":[{"en":"It is important for us to learn from inspiring people.","cn":"向鼓舞人心的人学习对我们来说很重要。","usage":"It is + adj. + for sb. + to do 句型，it 作形式主语，真正的主语是后面的 to do。","search":"it is important for us to learn from inspiring people. 向鼓舞人心的人学习对我们来说很重要。 it is + adj. + for sb. + to do 句型，it 作形式主语，真正的主语是后面的 to do。"},{"en":"It is kind of her to help so many students in need.","cn":"她帮助这么多有困难的学生，真是善良。","usage":"It is + adj. + of sb. + to do 句型，形容人物品质时用 of。","search":"it is kind of her to help so many students in need. 她帮助这么多有困难的学生，真是善良。 it is + adj. + of sb. + to do 句型，形容人物品质时用 of。"},{"en":"Yuan Longping is known as the father of hybrid rice.","cn":"袁隆平被誉为杂交水稻之父。","usage":"be known as 表示“被誉为、作为……而闻名”，后接身份或称号。","search":"yuan longping is known as the father of hybrid rice. 袁隆平被誉为杂交水稻之父。 be known as 表示“被誉为、作为……而闻名”，后接身份或称号。"},{"en":"Zhang Guimei is known for her great love for her students.","cn":"张桂梅因对学生伟大的爱而闻名。","usage":"be known for 表示“因……而闻名”，后接原因或事迹。","search":"zhang guimei is known for her great love for her students. 张桂梅因对学生伟大的爱而闻名。 be known for 表示“因……而闻名”，后接原因或事迹。"},{"en":"She is admired for never giving up.","cn":"她因永不放弃而受到敬佩。","usage":"be admired for 表示“因……而受到敬佩”，常用于点明人物值得敬佩之处。","search":"she is admired for never giving up. 她因永不放弃而受到敬佩。 be admired for 表示“因……而受到敬佩”，常用于点明人物值得敬佩之处。"},{"en":"She is a teacher who cares about every student.","cn":"她是一位关心每一位学生的老师。","usage":"who 引导的定语从句，用于补充说明人物的品质。","search":"she is a teacher who cares about every student. 她是一位关心每一位学生的老师。 who 引导的定语从句，用于补充说明人物的品质。"},{"en":"He not only works hard but also helps others.","cn":"他不仅努力工作，而且乐于助人。","usage":"not only...but also... 连接两个并列部分，表示“不但……而且……”。","search":"he not only works hard but also helps others. 他不仅努力工作，而且乐于助人。 not only...but also... 连接两个并列部分，表示“不但……而且……”。"},{"en":"I admire her so much that I will learn from her forever.","cn":"我非常敬佩她，以至于我会永远向她学习。","usage":"so...that... 表达敬佩程度之深，与学习决心结合，适合用在结尾段。","search":"i admire her so much that i will learn from her forever. 我非常敬佩她，以至于我会永远向她学习。 so...that... 表达敬佩程度之深，与学习决心结合，适合用在结尾段。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u2-a1","unit":2,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"一位激励我的人","enTitle":"An Inspiring Person","words":"约142词","wordsApprox":142,"paragraphs":["Everyone has a person who lights up his or her life. For me, that person is my neighbor Mr. Wang, a retired engineer who never stops learning.","At the age of sixty-five, Mr. Wang began to learn English by himself. It was not easy for him to remember new words, but he practiced every morning, no matter how cold or hot it was. He is known in our community for his strong will, and he is admired for turning his dream into reality. Not only did he pass the exam, but he also started a free English corner for children. His story tells me that age is never a reason to give up.","Mr. Wang is an ordinary man, but his spirit is so powerful that it always pushes me forward. Inspired by him, I will keep learning and never give up."],"analysis":{"text":"1）以 who 引导的定语从句 a retired engineer who never stops learning 引出人物，人物形象一目了然；2）It was not easy for him to remember new words 活用 It is + adj. + for sb. + to do 句型，be known for 与 be admired for 两个核心短语并用，衔接自然；3）not only...but also... 倒装句与结尾的 so...that...、非谓语动词 Inspired by him 相呼应，句式丰富却不显堆砌。","highlight":"Not only did he pass the exam, but he also started a free English corner for children.","highlightCn":"他不仅通过了考试，还为孩子们开办了一个免费英语角。"},"translation":null,"search":"一位激励我的人 an inspiring person everyone has a person who lights up his or her life. for me, that person is my neighbor mr. wang, a retired engineer who never stops learning. at the age of sixty-five, mr. wang began to learn english by himself. it was not easy for him to remember new words, but he practiced every morning, no matter how cold or hot it was. he is known in our community for his strong will, and he is admired for turning his dream into reality. not only did he pass the exam, but he also started a free english corner for children. his story tells me that age is never a reason to give up. mr. wang is an ordinary man, but his spirit is so powerful that it always pushes me forward. inspired by him, i will keep learning and never give up. 1）以 who 引导的定语从句 a retired engineer who never stops learning 引出人物，人物形象一目了然；2）it was not easy for him to remember new words 活用 it is + adj. + for sb. + to do 句型，be known for 与 be admired for 两个核心短语并用，衔接自然；3）not only...but also... 倒装句与结尾的 so...that...、非谓语动词 inspired by him 相呼应，句式丰富却不显堆砌。 not only did he pass the exam, but he also started a free english corner for children. 他不仅通过了考试，还为孩子们开办了一个免费英语角。"},{"id":"u2-a2","unit":2,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"我敬佩的老师","enTitle":"The Teacher I Admire","words":"约145词","wordsApprox":145,"paragraphs":["Of all my teachers, the one I admire most is Miss Li, who has taught us English for two years.","Miss Li is known for her lively classes, in which every student feels happy to speak. What impresses me most is her patience. It is common for us to make mistakes when learning a new language, but she never loses her temper. Instead, she explains again and again until everyone understands. Besides, she is admired for caring about us like an elder sister. Once I failed an exam and lost heart, and it was her warm words that helped me stand up again.","Thanks to her, not only have I made great progress in English, but I have also learned to face difficulties bravely. She is so excellent that I want to become a teacher like her. I will study hard to realize my dream."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇即用 who 非限制性定语从句点明人物身份，简洁而地道；2）第二段中 It is common for us to make mistakes when learning a new language 将 It is + adj. + for sb. + to do 与现在分词短语并用，be known for、be admired for 双双亮相，紧扣单元语法；3）结尾 not only...but also... 倒装与 so...that... 连用，既写影响又写决心，结构完整、情感真挚。","highlight":"Thanks to her, not only have I made great progress in English, but I have also learned to face difficulties bravely.","highlightCn":"多亏了她，我不仅在英语上取得了很大进步，还学会了勇敢地面对困难。"},"translation":null,"search":"我敬佩的老师 the teacher i admire of all my teachers, the one i admire most is miss li, who has taught us english for two years. miss li is known for her lively classes, in which every student feels happy to speak. what impresses me most is her patience. it is common for us to make mistakes when learning a new language, but she never loses her temper. instead, she explains again and again until everyone understands. besides, she is admired for caring about us like an elder sister. once i failed an exam and lost heart, and it was her warm words that helped me stand up again. thanks to her, not only have i made great progress in english, but i have also learned to face difficulties bravely. she is so excellent that i want to become a teacher like her. i will study hard to realize my dream. 1）开篇即用 who 非限制性定语从句点明人物身份，简洁而地道；2）第二段中 it is common for us to make mistakes when learning a new language 将 it is + adj. + for sb. + to do 与现在分词短语并用，be known for、be admired for 双双亮相，紧扣单元语法；3）结尾 not only...but also... 倒装与 so...that... 连用，既写影响又写决心，结构完整、情感真挚。 thanks to her, not only have i made great progress in english, but i have also learned to face difficulties bravely. 多亏了她，我不仅在英语上取得了很大进步，还学会了勇敢地面对困难。"},{"id":"u2-a3","unit":2,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"袁隆平：我敬佩的科学家","enTitle":"Yuan Longping, the Scientist I Admire","words":"约128词","wordsApprox":128,"paragraphs":["Yuan Longping, known as the father of hybrid rice, is the scientist I admire most.","It is not easy for anyone to spend his or her whole life doing one thing, but Yuan Longping did it. He spent his whole life researching rice, so that millions of people no longer go hungry. He was a scientist who never stopped working, because his simple dream was to feed more people. It was his hard work that turned this dream into reality.","So great was his contribution that people all over the world admire him for it. Sadly, he passed away in 2021, but his spirit lives on. Inspired by him, I have learned to work hard for a meaningful dream. I hope to be a useful person like him."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用过去分词短语 known as the father of hybrid rice 作定语，点明人物身份，简洁有力；2）It is not easy for anyone to spend his or her whole life doing one thing 用 It is + adj. + for sb. + to do 句型评价其一生坚守，who 定语从句与 so that 结构自然衔接；3）结尾 so...that... 倒装句与 admire...for...、非谓语动词 Inspired by him 并用，文采与主题兼得。","highlight":"So great was his contribution that people all over the world admire him for it.","highlightCn":"他的贡献如此巨大，以至于全世界人民都敬佩他。"},"translation":null,"search":"袁隆平：我敬佩的科学家 yuan longping, the scientist i admire yuan longping, known as the father of hybrid rice, is the scientist i admire most. it is not easy for anyone to spend his or her whole life doing one thing, but yuan longping did it. he spent his whole life researching rice, so that millions of people no longer go hungry. he was a scientist who never stopped working, because his simple dream was to feed more people. it was his hard work that turned this dream into reality. so great was his contribution that people all over the world admire him for it. sadly, he passed away in 2021, but his spirit lives on. inspired by him, i have learned to work hard for a meaningful dream. i hope to be a useful person like him. 1）开篇用过去分词短语 known as the father of hybrid rice 作定语，点明人物身份，简洁有力；2）it is not easy for anyone to spend his or her whole life doing one thing 用 it is + adj. + for sb. + to do 句型评价其一生坚守，who 定语从句与 so that 结构自然衔接；3）结尾 so...that... 倒装句与 admire...for...、非谓语动词 inspired by him 并用，文采与主题兼得。 so great was his contribution that people all over the world admire him for it. 他的贡献如此巨大，以至于全世界人民都敬佩他。"},{"id":"u2-a4","unit":2,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"我的榜样——妈妈","enTitle":"My Role Model, My Mother","words":"约139词","wordsApprox":139,"paragraphs":["Many people ask me who my role model is. My answer is always my mother, an ordinary woman who does extraordinary things.","My mother is known in our family for her kindness, and she is admired for her strong will. It is not easy for a woman to work during the day and take care of the family at night, but she has done this for years without a word of complaint. Last year, when my grandmother was ill, my mother took care of her patiently after work. She was so tired that she often fell asleep on the sofa, but she never gave up.","Inspired by my mother, I have learned that love means giving, not only words but also actions. I will try my best to be a person who brings warmth to others, just like her."],"analysis":{"text":"1）an ordinary woman who does extraordinary things 用 who 定语从句将 ordinary 与 extraordinary 对照，令人过目不忘；2）第二段一口气融入 It is + adj. + for sb. + to do、be known for、be admired for 三个核心句型，评价人物品质精准到位；3）so...that... 写妈妈的辛劳，结尾 not only...but also... 与 who 从句升华主题，首尾呼应。","highlight":"My mother is known in our family for her kindness, and she is admired for her strong will.","highlightCn":"妈妈在我们家里以善良著称，也因坚强的意志而受到敬佩。"},"translation":null,"search":"我的榜样——妈妈 my role model, my mother many people ask me who my role model is. my answer is always my mother, an ordinary woman who does extraordinary things. my mother is known in our family for her kindness, and she is admired for her strong will. it is not easy for a woman to work during the day and take care of the family at night, but she has done this for years without a word of complaint. last year, when my grandmother was ill, my mother took care of her patiently after work. she was so tired that she often fell asleep on the sofa, but she never gave up. inspired by my mother, i have learned that love means giving, not only words but also actions. i will try my best to be a person who brings warmth to others, just like her. 1）an ordinary woman who does extraordinary things 用 who 定语从句将 ordinary 与 extraordinary 对照，令人过目不忘；2）第二段一口气融入 it is + adj. + for sb. + to do、be known for、be admired for 三个核心句型，评价人物品质精准到位；3）so...that... 写妈妈的辛劳，结尾 not only...but also... 与 who 从句升华主题，首尾呼应。 my mother is known in our family for her kindness, and she is admired for her strong will. 妈妈在我们家里以善良著称，也因坚强的意志而受到敬佩。"},{"id":"u2-a5","unit":2,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"时代楷模张桂梅","enTitle":"An Inspiring Teacher: Zhang Guimei","words":"约140词","wordsApprox":140,"paragraphs":["Zhang Guimei is an inspiring teacher who is admired by the whole nation.","She is the principal of a free high school for girls in the mountains of Yunnan. It was not easy for her to run the school, but she never gave up. Thanks to her great love and hard work, thousands of girls have walked out of the mountains and entered universities. She is known for her spirit of never giving up, and she is admired for changing so many girls' lives.","So powerful is her love that it has changed the lives of so many families. She shows us that a common person can do uncommon things. Inspired by her, I will not only cherish my chance to study but also help others in need. I will work hard to make the world warmer, just like her."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇 who 定语从句加 be admired by 一句点题，人物身份与主题自然融合；2）It is + adj. + for sb. + to do、be known for、be admired for 三连用，紧扣本单元语法重点，信息密度高；3）结尾 so...that... 倒装句与 not only...but also... 并用，表达敬佩与学习决心，主题得到升华。","highlight":"So powerful is her love that it has changed the lives of so many families.","highlightCn":"她的爱如此有力量，以至于改变了许多家庭的命运。"},"translation":null,"search":"时代楷模张桂梅 an inspiring teacher: zhang guimei zhang guimei is an inspiring teacher who is admired by the whole nation. she is the principal of a free high school for girls in the mountains of yunnan. it was not easy for her to run the school, but she never gave up. thanks to her great love and hard work, thousands of girls have walked out of the mountains and entered universities. she is known for her spirit of never giving up, and she is admired for changing so many girls' lives. so powerful is her love that it has changed the lives of so many families. she shows us that a common person can do uncommon things. inspired by her, i will not only cherish my chance to study but also help others in need. i will work hard to make the world warmer, just like her. 1）开篇 who 定语从句加 be admired by 一句点题，人物身份与主题自然融合；2）it is + adj. + for sb. + to do、be known for、be admired for 三连用，紧扣本单元语法重点，信息密度高；3）结尾 so...that... 倒装句与 not only...but also... 并用，表达敬佩与学习决心，主题得到升华。 so powerful is her love that it has changed the lives of so many families. 她的爱如此有力量，以至于改变了许多家庭的命运。"},{"id":"u2-b1","unit":2,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"我敬佩的一个人","enTitle":"The Person I Admire","words":"约88词","wordsApprox":88,"paragraphs":["The person I admire is my grandfather. He is an old teacher, and he is very kind to everyone.","First, he works very hard. He taught in a village school for many years. Second, he is very kind. He often helps his students and neighbors. Finally, he never stops learning. He still reads books every day, and he knows a lot.","I think my grandfather is a great man. I want to be a person like him. I will study hard and try my best to help others."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我敬佩的人是我的爷爷。他是一位老教师，而且对每一个人都非常友善。首先，他工作非常努力。他在一所乡村学校教了很多年书。第二，他非常善良。他经常帮助他的学生和邻居。最后，他从不停止学习。他仍然每天读书，而且懂得很多。我认为爷爷是一个了不起的人。我想成为像他那样的人。我会努力学习，并尽我所能帮助别人。","search":"我敬佩的一个人 the person i admire the person i admire is my grandfather. he is an old teacher, and he is very kind to everyone. first, he works very hard. he taught in a village school for many years. second, he is very kind. he often helps his students and neighbors. finally, he never stops learning. he still reads books every day, and he knows a lot. i think my grandfather is a great man. i want to be a person like him. i will study hard and try my best to help others. 我敬佩的人是我的爷爷。他是一位老教师，而且对每一个人都非常友善。首先，他工作非常努力。他在一所乡村学校教了很多年书。第二，他非常善良。他经常帮助他的学生和邻居。最后，他从不停止学习。他仍然每天读书，而且懂得很多。我认为爷爷是一个了不起的人。我想成为像他那样的人。我会努力学习，并尽我所能帮助别人。"},{"id":"u2-b2","unit":2,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"我的英语老师","enTitle":"My English Teacher","words":"约89词","wordsApprox":89,"paragraphs":["My English teacher is Miss Wang. She is young and beautiful, and all the students like her.","First, her classes are very interesting. She often tells us English stories and plays games with us. Second, she is very patient. When we make mistakes, she never gets angry. She helps us again and again. Finally, she is like a friend to us. We can talk with her about everything.","I think Miss Wang is a great teacher. I admire her very much. I will study English hard to thank her."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我的英语老师是王老师。她年轻漂亮，所有学生都喜欢她。首先，她的课非常有趣。她经常给我们讲英语故事，还和我们一起做游戏。第二，她非常有耐心。我们犯错的时候，她从不生气。她一遍又一遍地帮助我们。最后，她就像我们的朋友一样。我们什么都愿意和她聊。我认为王老师是一位很棒的老师。我非常敬佩她。我会努力学好英语来感谢她。","search":"我的英语老师 my english teacher my english teacher is miss wang. she is young and beautiful, and all the students like her. first, her classes are very interesting. she often tells us english stories and plays games with us. second, she is very patient. when we make mistakes, she never gets angry. she helps us again and again. finally, she is like a friend to us. we can talk with her about everything. i think miss wang is a great teacher. i admire her very much. i will study english hard to thank her. 我的英语老师是王老师。她年轻漂亮，所有学生都喜欢她。首先，她的课非常有趣。她经常给我们讲英语故事，还和我们一起做游戏。第二，她非常有耐心。我们犯错的时候，她从不生气。她一遍又一遍地帮助我们。最后，她就像我们的朋友一样。我们什么都愿意和她聊。我认为王老师是一位很棒的老师。我非常敬佩她。我会努力学好英语来感谢她。"},{"id":"u2-b3","unit":2,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"我的妈妈","enTitle":"My Mother","words":"约92词","wordsApprox":92,"paragraphs":["My mother is the person I love best. She is a worker, and she is busy every day.","First, she is very hard-working. She works during the day and does the housework at night. Second, she is very kind. She always helps people in need. Finally, she loves me very much. She takes good care of me every day. When I am sad, she always stays with me and cheers me up.","I think my mother is the greatest person in the world. I will study hard and never let her down."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我的妈妈是我最爱的人。她是一名工人，每天都忙忙碌碌。首先，她非常勤劳。她白天上班，晚上做家务。第二，她非常善良。她总是帮助需要帮助的人。最后，她非常爱我。她每天都把我照顾得很好。我难过的时候，她总是陪着我，让我振作起来。我认为妈妈是世界上最好的人。我会努力学习，决不让她失望。","search":"我的妈妈 my mother my mother is the person i love best. she is a worker, and she is busy every day. first, she is very hard-working. she works during the day and does the housework at night. second, she is very kind. she always helps people in need. finally, she loves me very much. she takes good care of me every day. when i am sad, she always stays with me and cheers me up. i think my mother is the greatest person in the world. i will study hard and never let her down. 我的妈妈是我最爱的人。她是一名工人，每天都忙忙碌碌。首先，她非常勤劳。她白天上班，晚上做家务。第二，她非常善良。她总是帮助需要帮助的人。最后，她非常爱我。她每天都把我照顾得很好。我难过的时候，她总是陪着我，让我振作起来。我认为妈妈是世界上最好的人。我会努力学习，决不让她失望。"},{"id":"u2-b4","unit":2,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"袁隆平爷爷","enTitle":"Grandpa Yuan Longping","words":"约93词","wordsApprox":93,"paragraphs":["Yuan Longping is known as the father of hybrid rice. He is one of the greatest scientists in China.","First, he spent his whole life researching rice. He worked very hard every day. Second, his work was very important. It saved millions of people from hunger. They no longer had to worry about food. Finally, he never stopped working for the people. He passed away in 2021, but people will always remember him.","I admire Grandpa Yuan Longping very much. I will study hard and try to be a useful person like him."],"analysis":null,"translation":"袁隆平被誉为杂交水稻之父。他是中国最伟大的科学家之一。首先，他一生都在研究水稻。他每天都勤奋工作。第二，他的工作非常重要。它让千千万万的人摆脱了饥饿。人们再也不用为吃饭发愁。最后，他从未停止为人民工作。他于2021年逝世，但人们将永远记得他。我非常敬佩袁隆平爷爷。我会努力学习，努力成为像他一样有用的人。","search":"袁隆平爷爷 grandpa yuan longping yuan longping is known as the father of hybrid rice. he is one of the greatest scientists in china. first, he spent his whole life researching rice. he worked very hard every day. second, his work was very important. it saved millions of people from hunger. they no longer had to worry about food. finally, he never stopped working for the people. he passed away in 2021, but people will always remember him. i admire grandpa yuan longping very much. i will study hard and try to be a useful person like him. 袁隆平被誉为杂交水稻之父。他是中国最伟大的科学家之一。首先，他一生都在研究水稻。他每天都勤奋工作。第二，他的工作非常重要。它让千千万万的人摆脱了饥饿。人们再也不用为吃饭发愁。最后，他从未停止为人民工作。他于2021年逝世，但人们将永远记得他。我非常敬佩袁隆平爷爷。我会努力学习，努力成为像他一样有用的人。"},{"id":"u2-b5","unit":2,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"我想成为的人","enTitle":"The Person I Want to Be","words":"约92词","wordsApprox":92,"paragraphs":["I want to be a person who helps others. My dream is to be a doctor.","First, a doctor can help sick people get well. That is very important. Second, my uncle is a doctor, and he is my hero. He works very hard to save people's lives. I want to learn from him. Finally, being a doctor is not easy, but I am not afraid of difficulties.","I believe I can be a good doctor in the future. I will study hard from now on to make my dream come true."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我想成为一个帮助别人的人。我的梦想是当一名医生。首先，医生能帮助病人恢复健康。这非常重要。第二，我叔叔是一名医生，他是我的英雄。他努力工作，挽救人们的生命。我想向他学习。最后，当医生并不容易，但我不怕困难。我相信将来我能成为一名好医生。从现在起我会努力学习，让我的梦想成真。","search":"我想成为的人 the person i want to be i want to be a person who helps others. my dream is to be a doctor. first, a doctor can help sick people get well. that is very important. second, my uncle is a doctor, and he is my hero. he works very hard to save people's lives. i want to learn from him. finally, being a doctor is not easy, but i am not afraid of difficulties. i believe i can be a good doctor in the future. i will study hard from now on to make my dream come true. 我想成为一个帮助别人的人。我的梦想是当一名医生。首先，医生能帮助病人恢复健康。这非常重要。第二，我叔叔是一名医生，他是我的英雄。他努力工作，挽救人们的生命。我想向他学习。最后，当医生并不容易，但我不怕困难。我相信将来我能成为一名好医生。从现在起我会努力学习，让我的梦想成真。"}]},{"no":3,"enName":"Smart Learning","cnName":"智慧学习","grammar":"宾语从句（that / how / what / if 引导，一律用陈述语序）","task":"My Reading Habits（我的阅读习惯）","patterns":[{"en":"I think that smart learning means learning in smart ways.","cn":"我认为智慧学习意味着用智慧的方式学习。","usage":"that 引导的宾语从句，用于表达观点，从句必须使用陈述语序。","search":"i think that smart learning means learning in smart ways. 我认为智慧学习意味着用智慧的方式学习。 that 引导的宾语从句，用于表达观点，从句必须使用陈述语序。"},{"en":"I believe that good habits help us learn better.","cn":"我相信好习惯能帮助我们学得更好。","usage":"believe 后接 that 引导的宾语从句，表达自己的看法。","search":"i believe that good habits help us learn better. 我相信好习惯能帮助我们学得更好。 believe 后接 that 引导的宾语从句，表达自己的看法。"},{"en":"I wonder how I can improve my reading speed.","cn":"我想知道怎样才能提高阅读速度。","usage":"how 引导的宾语从句，注意语序为“how + 主语 + 谓语”。","search":"i wonder how i can improve my reading speed. 我想知道怎样才能提高阅读速度。 how 引导的宾语从句，注意语序为“how + 主语 + 谓语”。"},{"en":"Please tell me what you usually do before an exam.","cn":"请告诉我考试前你通常做什么。","usage":"what 在宾语从句中充当宾语，从句同样用陈述语序。","search":"please tell me what you usually do before an exam. 请告诉我考试前你通常做什么。 what 在宾语从句中充当宾语，从句同样用陈述语序。"},{"en":"I learn new words by reading interesting stories.","cn":"我通过读有趣的故事学习生词。","usage":"by + doing 表示“通过……的方式”。","search":"i learn new words by reading interesting stories. 我通过读有趣的故事学习生词。 by + doing 表示“通过……的方式”。"},{"en":"You can improve your English by watching English movies.","cn":"你可以通过看英文电影来提高英语。","usage":"by doing 作方式状语，常用来回答“如何做”。","search":"you can improve your english by watching english movies. 你可以通过看英文电影来提高英语。 by doing 作方式状语，常用来回答“如何做”。"},{"en":"Why not make a study plan for the new term?","cn":"为什么不给新学期制定一个学习计划呢？","usage":"Why not + 动词原形，是常用的提建议句型。","search":"why not make a study plan for the new term? 为什么不给新学期制定一个学习计划呢？ why not + 动词原形，是常用的提建议句型。"},{"en":"How about listening to English songs every day?","cn":"每天听英文歌曲怎么样？","usage":"How about + 动词-ing，用于委婉地提出建议。","search":"how about listening to english songs every day? 每天听英文歌曲怎么样？ how about + 动词-ing，用于委婉地提出建议。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u3-a1","unit":3,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"我的阅读习惯","enTitle":"My Reading Habits","words":"约139词","wordsApprox":139,"paragraphs":["Reading plays an important role in my life. I believe that good reading habits are the key to smart learning.","Every evening, I spend about thirty minutes reading before going to bed. I usually choose books that interest me, such as stories, science magazines and short articles. While reading, I always keep a notebook beside me. When I meet new words, I don't stop at once. Instead, I try to guess their meanings from the context, which makes me a faster reader. After finishing a book, I write a short review and share it with my classmates. By doing this, I not only remember more details but also improve my writing.","The more I read, the wider my world becomes. Reading makes me feel relaxed after a busy day, and I think that it is a habit worth keeping."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用 that 引导的宾语从句直接点题，观点鲜明；2）非谓语动词连用（reading before going to bed、While reading、After finishing a book）句式简洁地道，which 引导的非限定性定语从句进一步补充好处；3）by doing 表示方式，not only...but also... 递进强调，结尾 the more...the more... 升华主题。","highlight":"The more I read, the wider my world becomes.","highlightCn":"我读得越多，我的世界就越广阔。"},"translation":null,"search":"我的阅读习惯 my reading habits reading plays an important role in my life. i believe that good reading habits are the key to smart learning. every evening, i spend about thirty minutes reading before going to bed. i usually choose books that interest me, such as stories, science magazines and short articles. while reading, i always keep a notebook beside me. when i meet new words, i don't stop at once. instead, i try to guess their meanings from the context, which makes me a faster reader. after finishing a book, i write a short review and share it with my classmates. by doing this, i not only remember more details but also improve my writing. the more i read, the wider my world becomes. reading makes me feel relaxed after a busy day, and i think that it is a habit worth keeping. 1）开篇用 that 引导的宾语从句直接点题，观点鲜明；2）非谓语动词连用（reading before going to bed、while reading、after finishing a book）句式简洁地道，which 引导的非限定性定语从句进一步补充好处；3）by doing 表示方式，not only...but also... 递进强调，结尾 the more...the more... 升华主题。 the more i read, the wider my world becomes. 我读得越多，我的世界就越广阔。"},{"id":"u3-a2","unit":3,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"我是怎样学好英语的","enTitle":"How I Learn English Well","words":"约142词","wordsApprox":142,"paragraphs":["English is my favorite subject, and I have found some smart ways to learn it well.","First, I listen to English songs and watch English movies every weekend. I believe that learning from real materials is much more interesting than only studying textbooks. Second, I keep a vocabulary notebook. When I come across a new word, I write down the sentence where it appears, which helps me remember it more easily. Third, I practice speaking by talking to myself in English and joining the English corner at school. By doing these things, I have made great progress in the past two years.","I think that interest and good methods are the keys to learning a language. The more I practice, the more confident I become. English has opened a new window for me, and it has become a part of my life."],"analysis":{"text":"1）where 引导的定语从句修饰 the sentence，用法准确自然；2）by talking to myself in English and joining the English corner 用 by doing 结构具体说明练习口语的方式；3）结尾先用 that 宾语从句总结观点，再以 the more...the more... 收束，层层递进、有力点题。","highlight":"The more I practice, the more confident I become.","highlightCn":"我练习得越多，就越自信。"},"translation":null,"search":"我是怎样学好英语的 how i learn english well english is my favorite subject, and i have found some smart ways to learn it well. first, i listen to english songs and watch english movies every weekend. i believe that learning from real materials is much more interesting than only studying textbooks. second, i keep a vocabulary notebook. when i come across a new word, i write down the sentence where it appears, which helps me remember it more easily. third, i practice speaking by talking to myself in english and joining the english corner at school. by doing these things, i have made great progress in the past two years. i think that interest and good methods are the keys to learning a language. the more i practice, the more confident i become. english has opened a new window for me, and it has become a part of my life. 1）where 引导的定语从句修饰 the sentence，用法准确自然；2）by talking to myself in english and joining the english corner 用 by doing 结构具体说明练习口语的方式；3）结尾先用 that 宾语从句总结观点，再以 the more...the more... 收束，层层递进、有力点题。 the more i practice, the more confident i become. 我练习得越多，就越自信。"},{"id":"u3-a3","unit":3,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"如何成为成功的学习者","enTitle":"How to Become a Successful Learner","words":"约144词","wordsApprox":144,"paragraphs":["Everyone wants to be a successful learner, but not everyone knows how. Here is what I have learned from my own experience.","First, set clear goals. A learner who has a clear goal knows what he wants and works harder for it. Second, ask questions bravely. I think that asking questions is not a sign of weakness; it shows that you really want to understand. When I have a problem, I ask my teachers or classmates for help instead of giving up. Third, learn from your mistakes. I keep a notebook of my mistakes and review it every week, which helps me avoid making the same ones again.","In a word, success comes from good habits, not from talent alone. By keeping these habits, you will find that learning becomes easier and more enjoyable. The more you put in, the more you will get."],"analysis":{"text":"1）who 引导的定语从句与 what 宾语从句嵌套使用，句式紧凑，语序正确；2）I think that 宾语从句中再嵌套 that 从句，层次丰富；3）结尾 By keeping these habits 呼应本单元 by doing 语法，并用 the more...the more... 总结升华。","highlight":"A learner who has a clear goal knows what he wants and works harder for it.","highlightCn":"目标明确的学习者知道自己想要什么，并为此更加努力。"},"translation":null,"search":"如何成为成功的学习者 how to become a successful learner everyone wants to be a successful learner, but not everyone knows how. here is what i have learned from my own experience. first, set clear goals. a learner who has a clear goal knows what he wants and works harder for it. second, ask questions bravely. i think that asking questions is not a sign of weakness; it shows that you really want to understand. when i have a problem, i ask my teachers or classmates for help instead of giving up. third, learn from your mistakes. i keep a notebook of my mistakes and review it every week, which helps me avoid making the same ones again. in a word, success comes from good habits, not from talent alone. by keeping these habits, you will find that learning becomes easier and more enjoyable. the more you put in, the more you will get. 1）who 引导的定语从句与 what 宾语从句嵌套使用，句式紧凑，语序正确；2）i think that 宾语从句中再嵌套 that 从句，层次丰富；3）结尾 by keeping these habits 呼应本单元 by doing 语法，并用 the more...the more... 总结升华。 a learner who has a clear goal knows what he wants and works harder for it. 目标明确的学习者知道自己想要什么，并为此更加努力。"},{"id":"u3-a4","unit":3,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"我学习一项新技能的经历","enTitle":"How I Learned a New Skill","words":"约139词","wordsApprox":139,"paragraphs":["Last summer holiday, I decided to learn a new skill: cooking. Now I want to share with you how I learned it.","At first, I thought that cooking was as easy as boiling water, but my first dish told me that I was wrong. It looked terrible. Instead of giving up, I asked my mother to be my teacher. She showed me how to cut vegetables, control the heat and add salt little by little. I practiced every weekend, watching videos and writing down every step that I needed to remember. By doing this again and again, I finally cooked a meal that my whole family enjoyed.","Now I can cook several dishes for my family. This experience taught me that learning a new skill takes time and patience, and I think that it is really worth the effort."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用 how 引导的宾语从句点题，自然引出下文；2）非谓语动词作伴随状语（watching videos and writing down every step that I needed to remember），画面感强；3）两个 that 定语从句与宾语从句交替出现，语法亮点密集却自然。","highlight":"By doing this again and again, I finally cooked a meal that my whole family enjoyed.","highlightCn":"通过一次又一次地练习，我终于做出了一道全家人都爱吃的菜。"},"translation":null,"search":"我学习一项新技能的经历 how i learned a new skill last summer holiday, i decided to learn a new skill: cooking. now i want to share with you how i learned it. at first, i thought that cooking was as easy as boiling water, but my first dish told me that i was wrong. it looked terrible. instead of giving up, i asked my mother to be my teacher. she showed me how to cut vegetables, control the heat and add salt little by little. i practiced every weekend, watching videos and writing down every step that i needed to remember. by doing this again and again, i finally cooked a meal that my whole family enjoyed. now i can cook several dishes for my family. this experience taught me that learning a new skill takes time and patience, and i think that it is really worth the effort. 1）开篇用 how 引导的宾语从句点题，自然引出下文；2）非谓语动词作伴随状语（watching videos and writing down every step that i needed to remember），画面感强；3）两个 that 定语从句与宾语从句交替出现，语法亮点密集却自然。 by doing this again and again, i finally cooked a meal that my whole family enjoyed. 通过一次又一次地练习，我终于做出了一道全家人都爱吃的菜。"},{"id":"u3-a5","unit":3,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"演讲稿：智慧学习时代的学习方式","enTitle":"Smart Learning in Our Life","words":"约132词","wordsApprox":132,"paragraphs":["Dear teachers and students,","Good morning! I am glad to stand here and talk about smart learning in our life.","Today, technology has changed the way we learn. We can not only study in the classroom but also learn anywhere with our phones and computers. I think that smart learning means learning in smart ways, not just using smart tools. For example, I use an app to make a study plan, which helps me manage my time well. When I read an article online, I ask myself what I can learn from it. By doing this, I turn information into knowledge. The more active you are, the more you will learn.","Let us become smart learners. Believe in yourself, find the methods that suit you best, and never stop learning. Thank you!"],"analysis":{"text":"1）演讲稿要素完整：称呼、问候、正文、号召、致谢，符合文体要求；2）not only...but also... 展现科技带来的变化，which 非限定性定语从句补充说明，句式多样；3）what I can learn from it 为 wh- 宾语从句，陈述语序正确；结尾三个祈使句排比收束，富有感染力。","highlight":"The more active you are, the more you will learn.","highlightCn":"你越主动，学到的东西就越多。"},"translation":null,"search":"演讲稿：智慧学习时代的学习方式 smart learning in our life dear teachers and students, good morning! i am glad to stand here and talk about smart learning in our life. today, technology has changed the way we learn. we can not only study in the classroom but also learn anywhere with our phones and computers. i think that smart learning means learning in smart ways, not just using smart tools. for example, i use an app to make a study plan, which helps me manage my time well. when i read an article online, i ask myself what i can learn from it. by doing this, i turn information into knowledge. the more active you are, the more you will learn. let us become smart learners. believe in yourself, find the methods that suit you best, and never stop learning. thank you! 1）演讲稿要素完整：称呼、问候、正文、号召、致谢，符合文体要求；2）not only...but also... 展现科技带来的变化，which 非限定性定语从句补充说明，句式多样；3）what i can learn from it 为 wh- 宾语从句，陈述语序正确；结尾三个祈使句排比收束，富有感染力。 the more active you are, the more you will learn. 你越主动，学到的东西就越多。"},{"id":"u3-b1","unit":3,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"我是如何读书的","enTitle":"How I Read Books","words":"约92词","wordsApprox":92,"paragraphs":["I like reading very much. I think that reading is a good habit.","First, I read for half an hour after dinner every day. I like storybooks and science books. Second, I write down new words and beautiful sentences in my notebook, and I look at them on weekends. By doing this, I remember more words and sentences. Finally, I go to the library with my classmates once a week. We choose books together and talk about them.","Reading makes me happy. I believe that I will keep reading all my life."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我非常喜欢读书。我认为读书是一个好习惯。首先，我每天晚饭后读半小时的书。我喜欢故事书和科普书。其次，我把生词和优美的句子记在笔记本上，周末再拿出来看一看。这样做，我能记住更多的单词和句子。最后，我每周和同学一起去一次图书馆。我们一起选书，然后谈论书中的内容。读书让我感到快乐。我相信我会一辈子坚持读书。","search":"我是如何读书的 how i read books i like reading very much. i think that reading is a good habit. first, i read for half an hour after dinner every day. i like storybooks and science books. second, i write down new words and beautiful sentences in my notebook, and i look at them on weekends. by doing this, i remember more words and sentences. finally, i go to the library with my classmates once a week. we choose books together and talk about them. reading makes me happy. i believe that i will keep reading all my life. 我非常喜欢读书。我认为读书是一个好习惯。首先，我每天晚饭后读半小时的书。我喜欢故事书和科普书。其次，我把生词和优美的句子记在笔记本上，周末再拿出来看一看。这样做，我能记住更多的单词和句子。最后，我每周和同学一起去一次图书馆。我们一起选书，然后谈论书中的内容。读书让我感到快乐。我相信我会一辈子坚持读书。"},{"id":"u3-b2","unit":3,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"我是怎样学英语的","enTitle":"How I Learn English","words":"约97词","wordsApprox":97,"paragraphs":["English is an important subject. I think that learning English is not difficult if you have good ways.","First, I listen to the teacher carefully in class and take notes. Second, I read English words aloud every morning for ten minutes. I believe that this helps me remember them. I also listen to English songs at weekends. Finally, I practice English with my classmates. We talk about our school life in simple English. I am not afraid of making mistakes.","Now my English is much better than before. I am happy, and I will keep working hard."],"analysis":null,"translation":"英语是一门重要的学科。我认为，只要方法得当，学英语并不难。首先，我上课认真听老师讲课并记笔记。其次，我每天早上大声朗读英语单词十分钟。我相信这能帮助我记住单词。周末我还会听英文歌曲。最后，我和同学们一起练习英语。我们用简单的英语谈论学校生活。我不怕犯错。现在我的英语比以前好多了。我很开心，我会继续努力。","search":"我是怎样学英语的 how i learn english english is an important subject. i think that learning english is not difficult if you have good ways. first, i listen to the teacher carefully in class and take notes. second, i read english words aloud every morning for ten minutes. i believe that this helps me remember them. i also listen to english songs at weekends. finally, i practice english with my classmates. we talk about our school life in simple english. i am not afraid of making mistakes. now my english is much better than before. i am happy, and i will keep working hard. 英语是一门重要的学科。我认为，只要方法得当，学英语并不难。首先，我上课认真听老师讲课并记笔记。其次，我每天早上大声朗读英语单词十分钟。我相信这能帮助我记住单词。周末我还会听英文歌曲。最后，我和同学们一起练习英语。我们用简单的英语谈论学校生活。我不怕犯错。现在我的英语比以前好多了。我很开心，我会继续努力。"},{"id":"u3-b3","unit":3,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"如何提高我的成绩","enTitle":"How to Improve My Grades","words":"约101词","wordsApprox":101,"paragraphs":["I want to get better grades, so I made a plan. I think that good habits can help me a lot.","First, I listen to the teachers carefully in every class. I write down the important points in my notebook. Second, I do my homework by myself and check it after I finish. When I have problems, I ask my teachers for help. Finally, I review my lessons every evening and prepare for the new lessons. By doing these things, I remember my lessons well.","I believe that my grades will be better and better. I will keep these good habits."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我想取得更好的成绩，所以我制定了一个计划。我认为好习惯能给我很大帮助。首先，我每节课都认真听老师讲课，并把重点记在笔记本上。其次，我独立完成作业，做完后认真检查。遇到问题时，我向老师求助。最后，我每天晚上复习功课并预习新课。通过这样做，我把学过的知识记得很牢。我相信我的成绩会越来越好。我会保持这些好习惯。","search":"如何提高我的成绩 how to improve my grades i want to get better grades, so i made a plan. i think that good habits can help me a lot. first, i listen to the teachers carefully in every class. i write down the important points in my notebook. second, i do my homework by myself and check it after i finish. when i have problems, i ask my teachers for help. finally, i review my lessons every evening and prepare for the new lessons. by doing these things, i remember my lessons well. i believe that my grades will be better and better. i will keep these good habits. 我想取得更好的成绩，所以我制定了一个计划。我认为好习惯能给我很大帮助。首先，我每节课都认真听老师讲课，并把重点记在笔记本上。其次，我独立完成作业，做完后认真检查。遇到问题时，我向老师求助。最后，我每天晚上复习功课并预习新课。通过这样做，我把学过的知识记得很牢。我相信我的成绩会越来越好。我会保持这些好习惯。"},{"id":"u3-b4","unit":3,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"给朋友的学习建议","enTitle":"Advice on Learning","words":"约96词","wordsApprox":96,"paragraphs":["Dear friend,","I think that good learning habits can help you a lot. Here is my advice.","First, make a plan for every day. Write down what to do and when to do it. Second, listen to the teachers carefully in class. If you have questions, ask your teachers or classmates at once. Finally, don't stay up late. Get enough sleep every night, or you will feel tired the next day. I believe that good rest is also important for study.","I hope my advice can help you. Don't give up, and you will make progress."],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的朋友：我认为好的学习习惯能帮到你很多。下面是我的建议。首先，每天制定一个计划，写下要做的事以及做的时间。其次，上课认真听老师讲课。如果有问题，立刻向老师或同学请教。最后，不要熬夜。每晚保证充足的睡眠，否则第二天你会感到疲倦。我相信好好休息对学习也很重要。希望我的建议能帮到你。不要放弃，你会取得进步的。","search":"给朋友的学习建议 advice on learning dear friend, i think that good learning habits can help you a lot. here is my advice. first, make a plan for every day. write down what to do and when to do it. second, listen to the teachers carefully in class. if you have questions, ask your teachers or classmates at once. finally, don't stay up late. get enough sleep every night, or you will feel tired the next day. i believe that good rest is also important for study. i hope my advice can help you. don't give up, and you will make progress. 亲爱的朋友：我认为好的学习习惯能帮到你很多。下面是我的建议。首先，每天制定一个计划，写下要做的事以及做的时间。其次，上课认真听老师讲课。如果有问题，立刻向老师或同学请教。最后，不要熬夜。每晚保证充足的睡眠，否则第二天你会感到疲倦。我相信好好休息对学习也很重要。希望我的建议能帮到你。不要放弃，你会取得进步的。"},{"id":"u3-b5","unit":3,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"我学游泳的经历","enTitle":"How I Learned to Swim","words":"约104词","wordsApprox":104,"paragraphs":["Last summer, I learned to swim. It was not easy, but I did it. Here is how I did it.","First, my father taught me to breathe in the water. I was afraid at first, but he said I could do it. Second, I practiced moving my arms and legs by the pool every day. By doing this, I learned the right ways. Finally, I tried to swim in the pool. My father was always beside me. I drank some water at first, but I never gave up.","Now I can swim very well. I am very happy. I think that practice makes perfect."],"analysis":null,"translation":"去年夏天，我学会了游泳。这并不容易，但我做到了。下面讲讲我是怎么学会的。首先，爸爸教我在水中呼吸。起初我有点害怕，但他说我能行。其次，我每天在泳池边练习划动手臂和双腿。通过这样做，我掌握了正确的方法。最后，我尝试在泳池里游起来。爸爸一直陪在我身边。一开始我喝了几口水，但我从未放弃。现在我能游得很好了。我非常开心。我认为熟能生巧。","search":"我学游泳的经历 how i learned to swim last summer, i learned to swim. it was not easy, but i did it. here is how i did it. first, my father taught me to breathe in the water. i was afraid at first, but he said i could do it. second, i practiced moving my arms and legs by the pool every day. by doing this, i learned the right ways. finally, i tried to swim in the pool. my father was always beside me. i drank some water at first, but i never gave up. now i can swim very well. i am very happy. i think that practice makes perfect. 去年夏天，我学会了游泳。这并不容易，但我做到了。下面讲讲我是怎么学会的。首先，爸爸教我在水中呼吸。起初我有点害怕，但他说我能行。其次，我每天在泳池边练习划动手臂和双腿。通过这样做，我掌握了正确的方法。最后，我尝试在泳池里游起来。爸爸一直陪在我身边。一开始我喝了几口水，但我从未放弃。现在我能游得很好了。我非常开心。我认为熟能生巧。"}]},{"no":4,"enName":"Our Memory","cnName":"我们的记忆","grammar":"宾语从句（记忆与回忆话题中的宾语从句）","task":"Memory Challenge Diary（记忆挑战日记）","patterns":[{"en":"I still remember that I was very nervous at that time.","cn":"我仍然记得我当时非常紧张。","usage":"that 引导的宾语从句，用于引出回忆；从句必须用陈述语序。","search":"i still remember that i was very nervous at that time. 我仍然记得我当时非常紧张。 that 引导的宾语从句，用于引出回忆；从句必须用陈述语序。"},{"en":"I will never forget how happy I was that day.","cn":"我永远不会忘记那天我有多么开心。","usage":"how 引导的宾语从句，带有感叹语气；注意语序为 how + 形容词 + 主语 + 谓语。","search":"i will never forget how happy i was that day. 我永远不会忘记那天我有多么开心。 how 引导的宾语从句，带有感叹语气；注意语序为 how + 形容词 + 主语 + 谓语。"},{"en":"I believe that memory can be improved through practice.","cn":"我相信记忆力可以通过练习来提高。","usage":"believe + that 宾语从句表达观点；口语或写作中 that 可以省略。","search":"i believe that memory can be improved through practice. 我相信记忆力可以通过练习来提高。 believe + that 宾语从句表达观点；口语或写作中 that 可以省略。"},{"en":"I think it is important for us to review what we have learned in time.","cn":"我认为及时复习所学内容对我们很重要。","usage":"think 后接宾语从句，it 作形式主语，是谈论学习和记忆方法的高分句式。","search":"i think it is important for us to review what we have learned in time. 我认为及时复习所学内容对我们很重要。 think 后接宾语从句，it 作形式主语，是谈论学习和记忆方法的高分句式。"},{"en":"What I remember most clearly is my first day at school.","cn":"我记得最清楚的是我上学的第一天。","usage":"what 引导的从句作主语，用陈述语序，用于点出最难忘的片段。","search":"what i remember most clearly is my first day at school. 我记得最清楚的是我上学的第一天。 what 引导的从句作主语，用陈述语序，用于点出最难忘的片段。"},{"en":"I know that if we use new words often, we will never forget them.","cn":"我知道如果我们经常使用新单词，就永远不会忘记它们。","usage":"know 后接含 if 条件句的宾语从句；条件句用一般现在时，主句用 will。","search":"i know that if we use new words often, we will never forget them. 我知道如果我们经常使用新单词，就永远不会忘记它们。 know 后接含 if 条件句的宾语从句；条件句用一般现在时，主句用 will。"},{"en":"It is a good way to remember things by making pictures in our mind.","cn":"通过在脑海中画画来记东西是一种好方法。","usage":"It is a good way to do sth. 和 by doing sth. 都是介绍记忆方法的常用表达。","search":"it is a good way to remember things by making pictures in our mind. 通过在脑海中画画来记东西是一种好方法。 it is a good way to do sth. 和 by doing sth. 都是介绍记忆方法的常用表达。"},{"en":"This experience taught me that giving is more important than receiving.","cn":"这次经历教会了我：给予比索取更重要。","usage":"teach sb. + that 宾语从句，常用于总结经历带来的感悟，是结尾升华主题的佳句。","search":"this experience taught me that giving is more important than receiving. 这次经历教会了我：给予比索取更重要。 teach sb. + that 宾语从句，常用于总结经历带来的感悟，是结尾升华主题的佳句。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u4-a1","unit":4,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"我是如何提高记忆力的","enTitle":"How I Improve My Memory","words":"约138词","wordsApprox":138,"paragraphs":["Memory plays an important part in our study, and I have found some useful ways to improve mine.","First, I review what I have learned at the right time. I know that we forget things quickly at first, so I go over my notes on the same day.","Second, I turn new words into interesting pictures in my mind. For example, when I learn the word smile, I imagine a smiling face, which makes it much easier to remember.","Third, I explain what I have learned to my classmates, because teaching others is a great way to make knowledge stick.","In addition, getting enough sleep is necessary, for a tired brain cannot work well. Thanks to these methods, my memory has become better and better. I believe that if we keep practicing, everyone can remember things more easily."],"analysis":{"text":"1）结构清晰：开篇点明记忆的重要性，随后用 First、Second、Third 分条介绍三条记忆方法，结尾用 I believe that... 总结，层次分明；2）语法亮点：I know that...、I believe that... 等 that 引导的宾语从句使用准确，从句均为陈述语序；which makes it much easier to remember 用非限制性定语从句补充说明，句式多样；3）表达地道：review at the right time、go over my notes、make knowledge stick 等词组准确丰富，In addition、Thanks to 等连接词使行文流畅自然。","highlight":"For example, when I learn the word smile, I imagine a smiling face, which makes it much easier to remember.","highlightCn":"例如，当我学习 smile 这个单词时，我就会想象一张微笑的脸，这使它更容易被记住。"},"translation":null,"search":"我是如何提高记忆力的 how i improve my memory memory plays an important part in our study, and i have found some useful ways to improve mine. first, i review what i have learned at the right time. i know that we forget things quickly at first, so i go over my notes on the same day. second, i turn new words into interesting pictures in my mind. for example, when i learn the word smile, i imagine a smiling face, which makes it much easier to remember. third, i explain what i have learned to my classmates, because teaching others is a great way to make knowledge stick. in addition, getting enough sleep is necessary, for a tired brain cannot work well. thanks to these methods, my memory has become better and better. i believe that if we keep practicing, everyone can remember things more easily. 1）结构清晰：开篇点明记忆的重要性，随后用 first、second、third 分条介绍三条记忆方法，结尾用 i believe that... 总结，层次分明；2）语法亮点：i know that...、i believe that... 等 that 引导的宾语从句使用准确，从句均为陈述语序；which makes it much easier to remember 用非限制性定语从句补充说明，句式多样；3）表达地道：review at the right time、go over my notes、make knowledge stick 等词组准确丰富，in addition、thanks to 等连接词使行文流畅自然。 for example, when i learn the word smile, i imagine a smiling face, which makes it much easier to remember. 例如，当我学习 smile 这个单词时，我就会想象一张微笑的脸，这使它更容易被记住。"},{"id":"u4-a2","unit":4,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"一段难忘的回忆","enTitle":"An Unforgettable Memory","words":"约145词","wordsApprox":145,"paragraphs":["Among all my memories, the one that I will never forget is the day I won the school English speech contest last year. I still remember that I was so nervous that my hands were shaking before I went onto the stage.","However, my teacher said to me, “Believe in yourself. You can make it.” Her words, which were full of trust, gave me great courage. Taking a deep breath, I walked onto the stage and began my speech. To my surprise, I spoke more fluently than ever before, and the audience gave me warm applause. When the host announced that I had got first prize, I could hardly believe my ears. This experience taught me an important lesson: confidence comes from hard work. It also made me believe that we can achieve anything if we never give up. What an unforgettable memory it is!"],"analysis":{"text":"1）结构清晰：以 Among all my memories 开篇、that 引导的定语从句点题，按“赛前紧张、老师鼓励、上台演讲、获奖”的顺序推进，结尾用感叹句呼应标题；2）语法亮点：I still remember that...、announced that... 的宾语从句使用规范；so nervous that my hands were shaking 用 so...that... 生动写出紧张程度；Taking a deep breath 现在分词作状语，简洁有力；3）表达地道：Believe in yourself、make it、To my surprise、hardly believe my ears 等表达准确自然，which were full of trust 非限制性定语从句融入自然。","highlight":"I was so nervous that my hands were shaking before I went onto the stage.","highlightCn":"在上台之前，我紧张得双手都在发抖。"},"translation":null,"search":"一段难忘的回忆 an unforgettable memory among all my memories, the one that i will never forget is the day i won the school english speech contest last year. i still remember that i was so nervous that my hands were shaking before i went onto the stage. however, my teacher said to me, “believe in yourself. you can make it.” her words, which were full of trust, gave me great courage. taking a deep breath, i walked onto the stage and began my speech. to my surprise, i spoke more fluently than ever before, and the audience gave me warm applause. when the host announced that i had got first prize, i could hardly believe my ears. this experience taught me an important lesson: confidence comes from hard work. it also made me believe that we can achieve anything if we never give up. what an unforgettable memory it is! 1）结构清晰：以 among all my memories 开篇、that 引导的定语从句点题，按“赛前紧张、老师鼓励、上台演讲、获奖”的顺序推进，结尾用感叹句呼应标题；2）语法亮点：i still remember that...、announced that... 的宾语从句使用规范；so nervous that my hands were shaking 用 so...that... 生动写出紧张程度；taking a deep breath 现在分词作状语，简洁有力；3）表达地道：believe in yourself、make it、to my surprise、hardly believe my ears 等表达准确自然，which were full of trust 非限制性定语从句融入自然。 i was so nervous that my hands were shaking before i went onto the stage. 在上台之前，我紧张得双手都在发抖。"},{"id":"u4-a3","unit":4,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"给同学的建议：如何提升记忆力","enTitle":"Advice on How to Improve Your Memory","words":"约145词","wordsApprox":145,"paragraphs":["Dear classmates, do you often forget what you have learned? Don't worry. Here is some advice on how to improve your memory.","First, pay full attention when you study. Scientists tell us that we remember things better if we focus on them.","Second, use what you have learned in your daily life, because practice makes perfect. For example, you can write English diaries or talk with your friends in English.","Third, try to connect new information with things you already know, which will help your brain store it more easily.","Fourth, don't forget to take breaks and do some exercise, for a healthy body leads to a strong memory. Remember: memory is like a muscle, and the more you use it, the stronger it gets. I hope these suggestions can help you. I am sure that if you keep trying, you will make great progress."],"analysis":{"text":"1）结构清晰：以问句开头引发共鸣，接着用 First、Second、Third、Fourth 分条给出建议，结尾用 I am sure that... 收束，是建议类文章的标准框架；2）语法亮点：what you have learned 作 forget 和 use 的宾语，语序正确；things you already know, which will help... 用省略关系代词的定语从句加非限制性定语从句，句式灵活；3）表达地道：pay full attention、practice makes perfect、take breaks 等表达丰富，the more you use it, the stronger it gets 用“越……越……”句型说理有力。","highlight":"Memory is like a muscle, and the more you use it, the stronger it gets.","highlightCn":"记忆力就像肌肉，你用得越多，它就越强。"},"translation":null,"search":"给同学的建议：如何提升记忆力 advice on how to improve your memory dear classmates, do you often forget what you have learned? don't worry. here is some advice on how to improve your memory. first, pay full attention when you study. scientists tell us that we remember things better if we focus on them. second, use what you have learned in your daily life, because practice makes perfect. for example, you can write english diaries or talk with your friends in english. third, try to connect new information with things you already know, which will help your brain store it more easily. fourth, don't forget to take breaks and do some exercise, for a healthy body leads to a strong memory. remember: memory is like a muscle, and the more you use it, the stronger it gets. i hope these suggestions can help you. i am sure that if you keep trying, you will make great progress. 1）结构清晰：以问句开头引发共鸣，接着用 first、second、third、fourth 分条给出建议，结尾用 i am sure that... 收束，是建议类文章的标准框架；2）语法亮点：what you have learned 作 forget 和 use 的宾语，语序正确；things you already know, which will help... 用省略关系代词的定语从句加非限制性定语从句，句式灵活；3）表达地道：pay full attention、practice makes perfect、take breaks 等表达丰富，the more you use it, the stronger it gets 用“越……越……”句型说理有力。 memory is like a muscle, and the more you use it, the stronger it gets. 记忆力就像肌肉，你用得越多，它就越强。"},{"id":"u4-a4","unit":4,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"我永远不会忘记的一天","enTitle":"A Day I Will Never Forget","words":"约140词","wordsApprox":140,"paragraphs":["A day that I will never forget is the day our class visited the old people's home last summer. Early in the morning, we arrived there with fruit and flowers that we had prepared for the old people. I still remember how happy they were when they saw us, and their smiles made me feel warm.","First, we cleaned their rooms and talked with them. An old man told us stories about his childhood, and we listened carefully.","Then we put on a wonderful show. I sang an English song, which made everyone laugh and clap.","Before we left, one grandma held my hands and said that our visit meant a lot to her. Seeing her tears, I was deeply moved. That day taught me that giving is more important than receiving. It is a day I will never forget."],"analysis":{"text":"1）结构清晰：开篇用定语从句 a day that I will never forget 点题，正文按 Early in the morning、First、Then、Before we left 的时间顺序记叙，脉络清晰；2）语法亮点：I still remember how happy they were... 中 how 引导的宾语从句用陈述语序，规范准确；I sang an English song, which made everyone laugh and clap 用非限制性定语从句表达结果；3）表达地道：Seeing her tears, I was deeply moved 现在分词作状语，画面感强；结尾 taught me that giving is more important than receiving 用宾语从句升华主题。","highlight":"That day taught me that giving is more important than receiving.","highlightCn":"那一天教会了我：给予比索取更重要。"},"translation":null,"search":"我永远不会忘记的一天 a day i will never forget a day that i will never forget is the day our class visited the old people's home last summer. early in the morning, we arrived there with fruit and flowers that we had prepared for the old people. i still remember how happy they were when they saw us, and their smiles made me feel warm. first, we cleaned their rooms and talked with them. an old man told us stories about his childhood, and we listened carefully. then we put on a wonderful show. i sang an english song, which made everyone laugh and clap. before we left, one grandma held my hands and said that our visit meant a lot to her. seeing her tears, i was deeply moved. that day taught me that giving is more important than receiving. it is a day i will never forget. 1）结构清晰：开篇用定语从句 a day that i will never forget 点题，正文按 early in the morning、first、then、before we left 的时间顺序记叙，脉络清晰；2）语法亮点：i still remember how happy they were... 中 how 引导的宾语从句用陈述语序，规范准确；i sang an english song, which made everyone laugh and clap 用非限制性定语从句表达结果；3）表达地道：seeing her tears, i was deeply moved 现在分词作状语，画面感强；结尾 taught me that giving is more important than receiving 用宾语从句升华主题。 that day taught me that giving is more important than receiving. 那一天教会了我：给予比索取更重要。"},{"id":"u4-a5","unit":4,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"童年最珍贵的记忆","enTitle":"My Most Precious Childhood Memory","words":"约144词","wordsApprox":144,"paragraphs":["Of all my childhood memories, the most precious one is learning to ride a bike with my father. I was six years old then, and I was so afraid of falling that I dared not sit on the bike. My father said to me, “Don't be afraid. I will be right behind you.” Holding the back seat, he ran after me step by step. Slowly, I felt that the bike was getting steady. I rode faster and faster, laughing happily in the wind. When I turned around, I found that my father had let go of the bike long before, but he was still running behind me with a big smile. At that moment, I realized that my father's love was the strength that carried me forward. That summer afternoon is still fresh in my mind today. It is my most precious childhood memory."],"analysis":{"text":"1）结构清晰：Of all my childhood memories 开篇即点题，按“害怕上车、父亲扶车、独自骑行、发现父爱”的顺序推进，结尾回扣标题，首尾呼应；2）语法亮点：so afraid of falling that I dared not sit on the bike 用 so...that... 写出害怕；I felt that...、I found that...、I realized that... 三处宾语从句层层递进，从句语序全部正确；3）表达地道：Holding the back seat、laughing happily in the wind 非谓语动词作状语，细节生动；the strength that carried me forward 用定语从句升华父爱主题。","highlight":"At that moment, I realized that my father's love was the strength that carried me forward.","highlightCn":"那一刻，我意识到父亲的爱就是推动我前行的力量。"},"translation":null,"search":"童年最珍贵的记忆 my most precious childhood memory of all my childhood memories, the most precious one is learning to ride a bike with my father. i was six years old then, and i was so afraid of falling that i dared not sit on the bike. my father said to me, “don't be afraid. i will be right behind you.” holding the back seat, he ran after me step by step. slowly, i felt that the bike was getting steady. i rode faster and faster, laughing happily in the wind. when i turned around, i found that my father had let go of the bike long before, but he was still running behind me with a big smile. at that moment, i realized that my father's love was the strength that carried me forward. that summer afternoon is still fresh in my mind today. it is my most precious childhood memory. 1）结构清晰：of all my childhood memories 开篇即点题，按“害怕上车、父亲扶车、独自骑行、发现父爱”的顺序推进，结尾回扣标题，首尾呼应；2）语法亮点：so afraid of falling that i dared not sit on the bike 用 so...that... 写出害怕；i felt that...、i found that...、i realized that... 三处宾语从句层层递进，从句语序全部正确；3）表达地道：holding the back seat、laughing happily in the wind 非谓语动词作状语，细节生动；the strength that carried me forward 用定语从句升华父爱主题。 at that moment, i realized that my father's love was the strength that carried me forward. 那一刻，我意识到父亲的爱就是推动我前行的力量。"},{"id":"u4-b1","unit":4,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"难忘的一天","enTitle":"An Unforgettable Day","words":"约98词","wordsApprox":98,"paragraphs":["I will never forget one day last year. That morning, I went to the park with my best friend Li Hua.","First, we flew kites. The weather was fine, and we were very happy.","Second, we had a picnic by the lake. The food was delicious.","Finally, it began to rain, and we could not find our way home. We were worried, but a kind old man helped us and lent us an umbrella. Thanks to him, we got home safely. I think I will never forget this day. It taught me that helping others is very important."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我永远不会忘记去年的一天。那天早上，我和我最好的朋友李华去了公园。首先，我们放了风筝。天气很好，我们非常开心。其次，我们在湖边野餐。食物很美味。最后，天下起了雨，我们找不到回家的路了。我们很担心，但是一位好心的老人帮助了我们，还借给我们一把伞。多亏了他，我们安全地回到了家。我想我永远不会忘记这一天。它教会了我：帮助别人是非常重要的。","search":"难忘的一天 an unforgettable day i will never forget one day last year. that morning, i went to the park with my best friend li hua. first, we flew kites. the weather was fine, and we were very happy. second, we had a picnic by the lake. the food was delicious. finally, it began to rain, and we could not find our way home. we were worried, but a kind old man helped us and lent us an umbrella. thanks to him, we got home safely. i think i will never forget this day. it taught me that helping others is very important. 我永远不会忘记去年的一天。那天早上，我和我最好的朋友李华去了公园。首先，我们放了风筝。天气很好，我们非常开心。其次，我们在湖边野餐。食物很美味。最后，天下起了雨，我们找不到回家的路了。我们很担心，但是一位好心的老人帮助了我们，还借给我们一把伞。多亏了他，我们安全地回到了家。我想我永远不会忘记这一天。它教会了我：帮助别人是非常重要的。"},{"id":"u4-b2","unit":4,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"我的记忆方法","enTitle":"My Ways of Remembering Things","words":"约99词","wordsApprox":99,"paragraphs":["Remembering things well is important for my study. Here are my ways of remembering things.","First, I write new words and important points in my notebook. I look at them every day, so they stay in my mind.","Second, I review my lessons in time. I know that if I review them quickly, I will not forget them easily.","Finally, I try to use the new words in my daily life. For example, I write English diaries and talk with my classmates in English. I believe these ways are useful. I hope my memory will become better and better."],"analysis":null,"translation":"记好事情对我的学习很重要。下面是我记忆事情的方法。首先，我把新单词和重点写在笔记本上。我每天都看它们，所以它们就留在了我的脑海里。其次，我及时复习功课。我知道如果及时复习，我就不会轻易忘记它们。最后，我努力在日常生活中运用这些新单词。例如，我写英语日记，并用英语和同学们交谈。我相信这些方法是有用的。我希望我的记忆力会越来越好。","search":"我的记忆方法 my ways of remembering things remembering things well is important for my study. here are my ways of remembering things. first, i write new words and important points in my notebook. i look at them every day, so they stay in my mind. second, i review my lessons in time. i know that if i review them quickly, i will not forget them easily. finally, i try to use the new words in my daily life. for example, i write english diaries and talk with my classmates in english. i believe these ways are useful. i hope my memory will become better and better. 记好事情对我的学习很重要。下面是我记忆事情的方法。首先，我把新单词和重点写在笔记本上。我每天都看它们，所以它们就留在了我的脑海里。其次，我及时复习功课。我知道如果及时复习，我就不会轻易忘记它们。最后，我努力在日常生活中运用这些新单词。例如，我写英语日记，并用英语和同学们交谈。我相信这些方法是有用的。我希望我的记忆力会越来越好。"},{"id":"u4-b3","unit":4,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"一次难忘的经历","enTitle":"An Unforgettable Experience","words":"约102词","wordsApprox":102,"paragraphs":["I have many good memories, but one experience is the most unforgettable. Last summer, I went to the countryside to visit my grandparents.","First, I helped my grandmother water the vegetables. It was hard work, but I was happy.","Second, my grandfather taught me how to fish by the river. I caught a big fish for the first time, and I was very excited.","Finally, in the evening, we had a big dinner together under the stars. The food was delicious. I believe that this experience is my best memory, because I learned a lot and felt the love of my family."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我有很多美好的回忆，但有一次经历最难忘。去年夏天，我去乡下看望我的爷爷奶奶。首先，我帮奶奶给蔬菜浇水。那很辛苦，但我很开心。其次，爷爷在河边教我钓鱼。我第一次钓到了一条大鱼，我非常兴奋。最后，晚上我们在星空下一起吃了一顿丰盛的晚餐。食物很美味。我相信这次经历是我最美好的回忆，因为我学到了很多，也感受到了家人的爱。","search":"一次难忘的经历 an unforgettable experience i have many good memories, but one experience is the most unforgettable. last summer, i went to the countryside to visit my grandparents. first, i helped my grandmother water the vegetables. it was hard work, but i was happy. second, my grandfather taught me how to fish by the river. i caught a big fish for the first time, and i was very excited. finally, in the evening, we had a big dinner together under the stars. the food was delicious. i believe that this experience is my best memory, because i learned a lot and felt the love of my family. 我有很多美好的回忆，但有一次经历最难忘。去年夏天，我去乡下看望我的爷爷奶奶。首先，我帮奶奶给蔬菜浇水。那很辛苦，但我很开心。其次，爷爷在河边教我钓鱼。我第一次钓到了一条大鱼，我非常兴奋。最后，晚上我们在星空下一起吃了一顿丰盛的晚餐。食物很美味。我相信这次经历是我最美好的回忆，因为我学到了很多，也感受到了家人的爱。"},{"id":"u4-b4","unit":4,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"我的童年回忆","enTitle":"My Childhood Memory","words":"约98词","wordsApprox":98,"paragraphs":["Childhood is the best time in my life. My favorite memory is about my grandma's garden, and I often played there when I was little.","First, I liked watching the flowers. They were red, yellow and white, and they were beautiful.","Second, I helped my grandma water the flowers every day. We worked and laughed together.","Finally, in autumn, we picked apples from the trees. They were big and sweet. I remember that I was very happy at that time. Now I still miss those days. I think my childhood is the most beautiful memory in my heart."],"analysis":null,"translation":"童年是我一生中最美好的时光。我最喜欢的回忆是关于奶奶的花园的，我小的时候经常在那里玩耍。首先，我喜欢看花。花儿有红的、黄的、白的，非常漂亮。其次，我每天帮奶奶浇花。我们一起劳动，一起欢笑。最后，秋天的时候，我们从树上摘苹果。苹果又大又甜。我记得那时候我非常开心。现在我仍然想念那些日子。我觉得我的童年是我心中最美丽的回忆。","search":"我的童年回忆 my childhood memory childhood is the best time in my life. my favorite memory is about my grandma's garden, and i often played there when i was little. first, i liked watching the flowers. they were red, yellow and white, and they were beautiful. second, i helped my grandma water the flowers every day. we worked and laughed together. finally, in autumn, we picked apples from the trees. they were big and sweet. i remember that i was very happy at that time. now i still miss those days. i think my childhood is the most beautiful memory in my heart. 童年是我一生中最美好的时光。我最喜欢的回忆是关于奶奶的花园的，我小的时候经常在那里玩耍。首先，我喜欢看花。花儿有红的、黄的、白的，非常漂亮。其次，我每天帮奶奶浇花。我们一起劳动，一起欢笑。最后，秋天的时候，我们从树上摘苹果。苹果又大又甜。我记得那时候我非常开心。现在我仍然想念那些日子。我觉得我的童年是我心中最美丽的回忆。"},{"id":"u4-b5","unit":4,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"我是怎样记英语单词的","enTitle":"How I Remember English Words","words":"约92词","wordsApprox":92,"paragraphs":["Remembering English words is not easy for me, but I have some good ways.","First, I read the words aloud every morning. Reading aloud helps me remember the spelling and the sound.","Second, I write each new word in a small notebook, and I often look at them.","Finally, I put new words into short sentences and review them every week. I believe that using words is the best way to remember them. In this way, the words stay in my mind for a long time. I think these ways are helpful."],"analysis":null,"translation":"记英语单词对我来说并不容易，但我有一些好方法。首先，我每天早上大声朗读单词。大声朗读帮助我记住拼写和发音。其次，我把每个新单词写在一个小本子上，并且经常看一看它们。最后，我把新单词放进短句里，并且每周复习它们。我相信运用单词是记住它们的最好方法。这样一来，这些单词就会在我的脑海里停留很长时间。我觉得这些方法很有帮助。","search":"我是怎样记英语单词的 how i remember english words remembering english words is not easy for me, but i have some good ways. first, i read the words aloud every morning. reading aloud helps me remember the spelling and the sound. second, i write each new word in a small notebook, and i often look at them. finally, i put new words into short sentences and review them every week. i believe that using words is the best way to remember them. in this way, the words stay in my mind for a long time. i think these ways are helpful. 记英语单词对我来说并不容易，但我有一些好方法。首先，我每天早上大声朗读单词。大声朗读帮助我记住拼写和发音。其次，我把每个新单词写在一个小本子上，并且经常看一看它们。最后，我把新单词放进短句里，并且每周复习它们。我相信运用单词是记住它们的最好方法。这样一来，这些单词就会在我的脑海里停留很长时间。我觉得这些方法很有帮助。"}]},{"no":5,"enName":"Power of Ideas","cnName":"思想的力量","grammar":"被动语态（am / is / are + done；was / were + done）","task":"An Invention（介绍一项发明）","patterns":[{"en":"Paper was invented in China.","cn":"纸是在中国被发明的。","usage":"一般过去时的被动语态（was + 过去分词），强调“被发明”。","search":"paper was invented in china. 纸是在中国被发明的。 一般过去时的被动语态（was + 过去分词），强调“被发明”。"},{"en":"The light bulb was invented by Edison in 1879.","cn":"电灯是爱迪生在1879年发明的。","usage":"was invented by 引出动作执行者，in 引出年份。","search":"the light bulb was invented by edison in 1879. 电灯是爱迪生在1879年发明的。 was invented by 引出动作执行者，in 引出年份。"},{"en":"The telephone was invented in 1876.","cn":"电话是在1876年被发明的。","usage":"be invented in + 时间，表示“在……被发明”。","search":"the telephone was invented in 1876. 电话是在1876年被发明的。 be invented in + 时间，表示“在……被发明”。"},{"en":"Paper is used for writing and printing.","cn":"纸被用来书写和印刷。","usage":"be used for doing sth.，说明发明物的用途。","search":"paper is used for writing and printing. 纸被用来书写和印刷。 be used for doing sth.，说明发明物的用途。"},{"en":"Paper is made of wood and bamboo.","cn":"纸是由木材和竹子制成的。","usage":"be made of 表示“由……制成”（能看出原材料）。","search":"paper is made of wood and bamboo. 纸是由木材和竹子制成的。 be made of 表示“由……制成”（能看出原材料）。"},{"en":"Smartphones are used by people all over the world.","cn":"智能手机被全世界的人们使用。","usage":"一般现在时的被动语态（are + 过去分词），表示现在的普遍情况。","search":"smartphones are used by people all over the world. 智能手机被全世界的人们使用。 一般现在时的被动语态（are + 过去分词），表示现在的普遍情况。"},{"en":"The mobile phone is used for keeping in touch with friends.","cn":"手机被用来与朋友保持联系。","usage":"be used for + 动名词短语，介绍发明的功能。","search":"the mobile phone is used for keeping in touch with friends. 手机被用来与朋友保持联系。 be used for + 动名词短语，介绍发明的功能。"},{"en":"It is made of glass and metal.","cn":"它是由玻璃和金属制成的。","usage":"be made of + 材料，介绍发明物的材质。","search":"it is made of glass and metal. 它是由玻璃和金属制成的。 be made of + 材料，介绍发明物的材质。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u5-a1","unit":5,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"造纸术：一项伟大的中国发明","enTitle":"Paper, a Great Chinese Invention","words":"约127词","wordsApprox":127,"paragraphs":["As we all know, paper is one of the greatest inventions in the world. Around 105 AD, it was improved by Cai Lun, a famous inventor in the Eastern Han Dynasty.","Before paper was invented, people wrote on bamboo or silk, which were either heavy or expensive. After Cai Lun's improvement, paper became much cheaper and lighter. It is made of wood, bamboo and other plants. Today, paper is used for writing, printing and making books. What's more, it is not only used in China but also in every corner of the world.","In my opinion, paper is more than a simple material. It carries knowledge and culture. Thanks to it, ideas can be passed from one generation to another. It truly shows the power of ideas."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用 As we all know 自然引入话题，第二句用被动语态 was improved by 准确写出蔡伦改进造纸术的人物与时间（约公元105年），信息严谨；2）第二段先用 which 引导的定语从句对比纸发明前竹简与丝帛“又重又贵”的缺点，再用 not only...but also... 强调纸的广泛使用，句式丰富、衔接自然；3）结尾用 carry 一词生动点明纸承载知识与文化的意义，自然升华到“思想的力量”这一单元主题。","highlight":"Thanks to it, ideas can be passed from one generation to another.","highlightCn":"多亏了纸，思想才能一代代传递下去。"},"translation":null,"search":"造纸术：一项伟大的中国发明 paper, a great chinese invention as we all know, paper is one of the greatest inventions in the world. around 105 ad, it was improved by cai lun, a famous inventor in the eastern han dynasty. before paper was invented, people wrote on bamboo or silk, which were either heavy or expensive. after cai lun's improvement, paper became much cheaper and lighter. it is made of wood, bamboo and other plants. today, paper is used for writing, printing and making books. what's more, it is not only used in china but also in every corner of the world. in my opinion, paper is more than a simple material. it carries knowledge and culture. thanks to it, ideas can be passed from one generation to another. it truly shows the power of ideas. 1）开篇用 as we all know 自然引入话题，第二句用被动语态 was improved by 准确写出蔡伦改进造纸术的人物与时间（约公元105年），信息严谨；2）第二段先用 which 引导的定语从句对比纸发明前竹简与丝帛“又重又贵”的缺点，再用 not only...but also... 强调纸的广泛使用，句式丰富、衔接自然；3）结尾用 carry 一词生动点明纸承载知识与文化的意义，自然升华到“思想的力量”这一单元主题。 thanks to it, ideas can be passed from one generation to another. 多亏了纸，思想才能一代代传递下去。"},{"id":"u5-a2","unit":5,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"智能手机：一项改变世界的发明","enTitle":"The Smartphone, an Invention That Changed the World","words":"约131词","wordsApprox":131,"paragraphs":["The smartphone is an invention that has truly changed the world. Since it was invented, it has become one of the most popular products in history.","A smartphone is used for doing many things, such as calling people, taking photos and learning online. It is not only a phone but also a small computer. With it, we can get information and keep in touch with friends easily. When we want to pay, we just use the phone instead of money. What's more, students can use it to take online classes and watch English videos.","Of course, we should use it wisely and not spend too much time on games. In a word, the smartphone has made our life more convenient and colorful. It is a great invention created by human wisdom."],"analysis":{"text":"1）首句用 that 引导的定语从句“an invention that has truly changed the world”开门见山地点题，高级且地道；2）第二段用 be used for doing 列举手机的多种用途，并用 not only...but also... 和 With it 结构组织句子，句型多样而不堆砌；3）结尾观点辩证：先肯定手机带来的便利，再提醒“use it wisely”，最后用过去分词短语 created by human wisdom 收尾，再次呼应单元主题。","highlight":"It is not only a phone but also a small computer.","highlightCn":"它不仅是一部电话，还是一台小型电脑。"},"translation":null,"search":"智能手机：一项改变世界的发明 the smartphone, an invention that changed the world the smartphone is an invention that has truly changed the world. since it was invented, it has become one of the most popular products in history. a smartphone is used for doing many things, such as calling people, taking photos and learning online. it is not only a phone but also a small computer. with it, we can get information and keep in touch with friends easily. when we want to pay, we just use the phone instead of money. what's more, students can use it to take online classes and watch english videos. of course, we should use it wisely and not spend too much time on games. in a word, the smartphone has made our life more convenient and colorful. it is a great invention created by human wisdom. 1）首句用 that 引导的定语从句“an invention that has truly changed the world”开门见山地点题，高级且地道；2）第二段用 be used for doing 列举手机的多种用途，并用 not only...but also... 和 with it 结构组织句子，句型多样而不堆砌；3）结尾观点辩证：先肯定手机带来的便利，再提醒“use it wisely”，最后用过去分词短语 created by human wisdom 收尾，再次呼应单元主题。 it is not only a phone but also a small computer. 它不仅是一部电话，还是一台小型电脑。"},{"id":"u5-a3","unit":5,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"我眼中最重要的发明","enTitle":"The Most Important Invention in My Eyes","words":"约131词","wordsApprox":131,"paragraphs":["There are many great inventions in the world, but in my eyes, the most important one is the telephone.","The telephone was invented by Bell in 1876. Before it was invented, people could only write letters to communicate with those far away, which took a long time. Today, the telephone is used for keeping people connected. No matter how far away we are, we can hear the voices of our family and friends at any time. It has not only saved people a lot of time but also brought hearts closer together.","The telephone has become a bridge between people. It shows us that a good idea can make the whole world smaller and warmer. In a word, the telephone has changed the way we communicate and made our life better."],"analysis":{"text":"1）首段用 There be 句型引出众多发明，再用“the most important one is...”清晰亮出观点，主题句明确；2）第二段用被动语态 was invented by Bell in 1876 准确交代电话的发明事实，并用 which 定语从句和非谓语动词 to communicate 对比今昔，内容丰富；3）结尾用 not only...but also... 总结电话的意义，“make the whole world smaller and warmer”表达形象，收束有力。","highlight":"It has not only saved people a lot of time but also brought hearts closer together.","highlightCn":"它不仅为人们节省了大量时间，还把人们的心拉得更近了。"},"translation":null,"search":"我眼中最重要的发明 the most important invention in my eyes there are many great inventions in the world, but in my eyes, the most important one is the telephone. the telephone was invented by bell in 1876. before it was invented, people could only write letters to communicate with those far away, which took a long time. today, the telephone is used for keeping people connected. no matter how far away we are, we can hear the voices of our family and friends at any time. it has not only saved people a lot of time but also brought hearts closer together. the telephone has become a bridge between people. it shows us that a good idea can make the whole world smaller and warmer. in a word, the telephone has changed the way we communicate and made our life better. 1）首段用 there be 句型引出众多发明，再用“the most important one is...”清晰亮出观点，主题句明确；2）第二段用被动语态 was invented by bell in 1876 准确交代电话的发明事实，并用 which 定语从句和非谓语动词 to communicate 对比今昔，内容丰富；3）结尾用 not only...but also... 总结电话的意义，“make the whole world smaller and warmer”表达形象，收束有力。 it has not only saved people a lot of time but also brought hearts closer together. 它不仅为人们节省了大量时间，还把人们的心拉得更近了。"},{"id":"u5-a4","unit":5,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"我梦想的发明","enTitle":"My Dream Invention","words":"约133词","wordsApprox":133,"paragraphs":["If I could invent something, I would invent a smart school bag, because I believe it can solve many problems for students.","My dream invention is called “Sunny Bag”. It is not only a bag but also a small robot. It is made of light and strong materials, so it is very easy to carry. More importantly, it is used for helping students in many ways. First, it can check our homework and point out mistakes, which saves us a lot of time. Second, when it rains, it can turn into an umbrella by itself. Third, it can tell us the right way to school if we get lost.","I hope this bag will be invented one day. I believe that with the power of ideas, no dream is too far to reach."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用虚拟语气 If I could... I would... 表达梦想，语气恰当，句型高级；2）主体用 First/Second/Third 使层次一目了然，穿插 which 定语从句与“turn into... by itself”等生动表达，并用 be made of、be used for 落实本单元语法；3）结尾“no dream is too far to reach”化用 too...to... 结构，点明“思想的力量”主题，首尾呼应、鼓舞人心。","highlight":"I believe that with the power of ideas, no dream is too far to reach.","highlightCn":"我相信，凭借思想的力量，没有实现不了的梦想。"},"translation":null,"search":"我梦想的发明 my dream invention if i could invent something, i would invent a smart school bag, because i believe it can solve many problems for students. my dream invention is called “sunny bag”. it is not only a bag but also a small robot. it is made of light and strong materials, so it is very easy to carry. more importantly, it is used for helping students in many ways. first, it can check our homework and point out mistakes, which saves us a lot of time. second, when it rains, it can turn into an umbrella by itself. third, it can tell us the right way to school if we get lost. i hope this bag will be invented one day. i believe that with the power of ideas, no dream is too far to reach. 1）开篇用虚拟语气 if i could... i would... 表达梦想，语气恰当，句型高级；2）主体用 first/second/third 使层次一目了然，穿插 which 定语从句与“turn into... by itself”等生动表达，并用 be made of、be used for 落实本单元语法；3）结尾“no dream is too far to reach”化用 too...to... 结构，点明“思想的力量”主题，首尾呼应、鼓舞人心。 i believe that with the power of ideas, no dream is too far to reach. 我相信，凭借思想的力量，没有实现不了的梦想。"},{"id":"u5-a5","unit":5,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"电灯的故事","enTitle":"The Story of the Light Bulb","words":"约127词","wordsApprox":127,"paragraphs":["Have you ever thought about what our nights were like before the light bulb was invented? The story of the light bulb is the story of an idea that changed the world.","The light bulb was invented by Thomas Edison, a great American inventor, in 1879. The bulb is made of glass and thin metal wires, and it is used for lighting up the darkness. Today, lights are used everywhere, in our homes, schools and streets. With them, we can read, study and work at night. It is hard to imagine what our life would be like without them.","The light bulb not only lights up our rooms but also lights up people's hearts. It tells us that a great idea can make life brighter and better."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用反问句 Have you ever thought about... 拉近与读者的距离，随即点明“一个改变世界的想法”这一主题，引入巧妙；2）第二段集中使用 was invented by、be made of、be used for 三个本单元核心被动结构，把电灯的发明者、时间、材质与用途写得准确清楚；3）结尾“lights up people's hearts”与上文“lighting up the darkness”呼应，一语双关，既总结事实又升华情感。","highlight":"The light bulb not only lights up our rooms but also lights up people's hearts.","highlightCn":"电灯不仅照亮了我们的房间，也照亮了人们的心灵。"},"translation":null,"search":"电灯的故事 the story of the light bulb have you ever thought about what our nights were like before the light bulb was invented? the story of the light bulb is the story of an idea that changed the world. the light bulb was invented by thomas edison, a great american inventor, in 1879. the bulb is made of glass and thin metal wires, and it is used for lighting up the darkness. today, lights are used everywhere, in our homes, schools and streets. with them, we can read, study and work at night. it is hard to imagine what our life would be like without them. the light bulb not only lights up our rooms but also lights up people's hearts. it tells us that a great idea can make life brighter and better. 1）开篇用反问句 have you ever thought about... 拉近与读者的距离，随即点明“一个改变世界的想法”这一主题，引入巧妙；2）第二段集中使用 was invented by、be made of、be used for 三个本单元核心被动结构，把电灯的发明者、时间、材质与用途写得准确清楚；3）结尾“lights up people's hearts”与上文“lighting up the darkness”呼应，一语双关，既总结事实又升华情感。 the light bulb not only lights up our rooms but also lights up people's hearts. 电灯不仅照亮了我们的房间，也照亮了人们的心灵。"},{"id":"u5-b1","unit":5,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"介绍手机","enTitle":"The Mobile Phone","words":"约89词","wordsApprox":89,"paragraphs":["The mobile phone is a very useful invention. Almost everyone has one today.","First, it was invented many years ago. It is made of plastic and metal. Second, it is used for calling people, sending messages and taking photos. We can also use it to listen to music and learn English. Finally, it is very important because it makes our life easy. It helps us keep in touch with our family and friends.","I think the mobile phone is a great invention. Our life is more convenient with it."],"analysis":null,"translation":"手机是一项非常有用的发明。如今，几乎人人都有手机。首先，手机是在很多年前被发明的。它是由塑料和金属制成的。其次，手机被用来打电话、发短信和拍照。我们还可以用它听音乐和学英语。最后，手机非常重要，因为它让我们的生活变得轻松。它帮助我们与家人和朋友保持联系。我认为手机是一项伟大的发明。有了它，我们的生活更加便利。","search":"介绍手机 the mobile phone the mobile phone is a very useful invention. almost everyone has one today. first, it was invented many years ago. it is made of plastic and metal. second, it is used for calling people, sending messages and taking photos. we can also use it to listen to music and learn english. finally, it is very important because it makes our life easy. it helps us keep in touch with our family and friends. i think the mobile phone is a great invention. our life is more convenient with it. 手机是一项非常有用的发明。如今，几乎人人都有手机。首先，手机是在很多年前被发明的。它是由塑料和金属制成的。其次，手机被用来打电话、发短信和拍照。我们还可以用它听音乐和学英语。最后，手机非常重要，因为它让我们的生活变得轻松。它帮助我们与家人和朋友保持联系。我认为手机是一项伟大的发明。有了它，我们的生活更加便利。"},{"id":"u5-b2","unit":5,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"介绍纸的发明","enTitle":"The Invention of Paper","words":"约96词","wordsApprox":96,"paragraphs":["Paper is one of the four great inventions of ancient China. It is very useful in our daily life.","First, paper was improved by Cai Lun in the Eastern Han Dynasty, around 105 AD. It is made of wood, bamboo and other plants. Second, paper is used for writing, drawing and printing. We use it to make books and newspapers. Finally, paper is important because it helps people share ideas and knowledge. Before it was invented, people wrote on bamboo or silk.","I think paper is a wonderful invention. It shows the wisdom of Chinese people."],"analysis":null,"translation":"纸是中国古代四大发明之一。它在我们的日常生活中非常有用。首先，纸是在东汉时期由蔡伦改进的，大约在公元105年。它是由木材、竹子和其他植物制成的。其次，纸被用来书写、绘画和印刷。我们用纸制作书本和报纸。最后，纸很重要，因为它帮助人们分享思想和知识。在纸被发明之前，人们在竹简或丝绸上写字。我认为纸是一项了不起的发明。它展示了中国人的智慧。","search":"介绍纸的发明 the invention of paper paper is one of the four great inventions of ancient china. it is very useful in our daily life. first, paper was improved by cai lun in the eastern han dynasty, around 105 ad. it is made of wood, bamboo and other plants. second, paper is used for writing, drawing and printing. we use it to make books and newspapers. finally, paper is important because it helps people share ideas and knowledge. before it was invented, people wrote on bamboo or silk. i think paper is a wonderful invention. it shows the wisdom of chinese people. 纸是中国古代四大发明之一。它在我们的日常生活中非常有用。首先，纸是在东汉时期由蔡伦改进的，大约在公元105年。它是由木材、竹子和其他植物制成的。其次，纸被用来书写、绘画和印刷。我们用纸制作书本和报纸。最后，纸很重要，因为它帮助人们分享思想和知识。在纸被发明之前，人们在竹简或丝绸上写字。我认为纸是一项了不起的发明。它展示了中国人的智慧。"},{"id":"u5-b3","unit":5,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"介绍电灯","enTitle":"The Light Bulb","words":"约88词","wordsApprox":88,"paragraphs":["The light bulb is a great invention. It brings light to the whole world.","First, it was invented by Thomas Edison in 1879. It is made of glass and metal. Second, it is used for lighting up our rooms, streets and schools. With it, people can work, read and study at night. Finally, it is very important because it changes our life. It makes our nights bright and safe.","I believe the light bulb is one of the greatest inventions in the world. I like it very much."],"analysis":null,"translation":"电灯是一项伟大的发明。它把光明带给了整个世界。首先，电灯是由托马斯·爱迪生在1879年发明的。它是由玻璃和金属制成的。其次，电灯被用来照亮我们的房间、街道和学校。有了电灯，人们可以在晚上工作、阅读和学习。最后，电灯非常重要，因为它改变了我们的生活。它让我们的夜晚明亮而安全。我相信电灯是世界上最伟大的发明之一。我非常喜欢它。","search":"介绍电灯 the light bulb the light bulb is a great invention. it brings light to the whole world. first, it was invented by thomas edison in 1879. it is made of glass and metal. second, it is used for lighting up our rooms, streets and schools. with it, people can work, read and study at night. finally, it is very important because it changes our life. it makes our nights bright and safe. i believe the light bulb is one of the greatest inventions in the world. i like it very much. 电灯是一项伟大的发明。它把光明带给了整个世界。首先，电灯是由托马斯·爱迪生在1879年发明的。它是由玻璃和金属制成的。其次，电灯被用来照亮我们的房间、街道和学校。有了电灯，人们可以在晚上工作、阅读和学习。最后，电灯非常重要，因为它改变了我们的生活。它让我们的夜晚明亮而安全。我相信电灯是世界上最伟大的发明之一。我非常喜欢它。"},{"id":"u5-b4","unit":5,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"介绍电脑","enTitle":"The Computer","words":"约89词","wordsApprox":89,"paragraphs":["The computer is one of the most important inventions in the world. It is very popular today.","First, it was invented in the 20th century. It is made of many small parts. Second, it is used for many things. We use it to study, work and play games. Students can learn English on it. Finally, it is important because it makes our life easy. It can work very fast and help people do many things.","I think the computer is a wonderful invention. I can't imagine life without it."],"analysis":null,"translation":"电脑是世界上最重要的发明之一。如今，它非常普及。首先，电脑是在二十世纪被发明的。它由许多小部件组成。其次，电脑被用来做很多事情。我们用电脑学习、工作和玩游戏。学生们可以在电脑上学习英语。最后，电脑很重要，因为它让我们的生活变得轻松。它运算速度很快，能帮助人们做很多事情。我认为电脑是一项了不起的发明。我无法想象没有它的生活。","search":"介绍电脑 the computer the computer is one of the most important inventions in the world. it is very popular today. first, it was invented in the 20th century. it is made of many small parts. second, it is used for many things. we use it to study, work and play games. students can learn english on it. finally, it is important because it makes our life easy. it can work very fast and help people do many things. i think the computer is a wonderful invention. i can't imagine life without it. 电脑是世界上最重要的发明之一。如今，它非常普及。首先，电脑是在二十世纪被发明的。它由许多小部件组成。其次，电脑被用来做很多事情。我们用电脑学习、工作和玩游戏。学生们可以在电脑上学习英语。最后，电脑很重要，因为它让我们的生活变得轻松。它运算速度很快，能帮助人们做很多事情。我认为电脑是一项了不起的发明。我无法想象没有它的生活。"},{"id":"u5-b5","unit":5,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"我想发明的东西","enTitle":"Something I Want to Invent","words":"约93词","wordsApprox":93,"paragraphs":["If I can invent something, I want to invent a robot to help me with my homework. This is my dream.","First, the robot is called Little Helper. It is made of light metal. Second, it is used for helping me study. It can read books and answer my questions. It can also carry my schoolbag. Finally, it is very important to me because I am very busy every day. It can save me a lot of time.","I believe one day my dream will come true. I will work hard for it."],"analysis":null,"translation":"如果我能发明东西，我想发明一个能帮我做作业的机器人。这是我的梦想。首先，这个机器人名叫“小帮手”。它是由轻质金属制成的。其次，它被用来帮助我学习。它能读书并回答我的问题。它还能帮我背书包。最后，它对我非常重要，因为我每天都很忙。它能为我节省很多时间。我相信有一天我的梦想会成真。我会为此而努力。","search":"我想发明的东西 something i want to invent if i can invent something, i want to invent a robot to help me with my homework. this is my dream. first, the robot is called little helper. it is made of light metal. second, it is used for helping me study. it can read books and answer my questions. it can also carry my schoolbag. finally, it is very important to me because i am very busy every day. it can save me a lot of time. i believe one day my dream will come true. i will work hard for it. 如果我能发明东西，我想发明一个能帮我做作业的机器人。这是我的梦想。首先，这个机器人名叫“小帮手”。它是由轻质金属制成的。其次，它被用来帮助我学习。它能读书并回答我的问题。它还能帮我背书包。最后，它对我非常重要，因为我每天都很忙。它能为我节省很多时间。我相信有一天我的梦想会成真。我会为此而努力。"}]},{"no":6,"enName":"Beyond Earth","cnName":"探索太空","grammar":"一般将来时的被动语态（will be + done）","task":"My Space Dream（我的太空梦）","patterns":[{"en":"I dream of becoming an astronaut one day.","cn":"我梦想有一天成为一名航天员。","usage":"dream of doing sth 表示“梦想做某事”，是表达梦想最常用的句型。","search":"i dream of becoming an astronaut one day. 我梦想有一天成为一名航天员。 dream of doing sth 表示“梦想做某事”，是表达梦想最常用的句型。"},{"en":"I hope that my dream will come true one day.","cn":"我希望有一天我的梦想会实现。","usage":"hope that + 宾语从句，用来表达对未来的美好希望。","search":"i hope that my dream will come true one day. 我希望有一天我的梦想会实现。 hope that + 宾语从句，用来表达对未来的美好希望。"},{"en":"More space stations will be built in the future.","cn":"未来将建造更多的空间站。","usage":"一般将来时的被动语态 will be + 过去分词，主语是动作的承受者。","search":"more space stations will be built in the future. 未来将建造更多的空间站。 一般将来时的被动语态 will be + 过去分词，主语是动作的承受者。"},{"en":"New planets will be discovered by scientists in the coming years.","cn":"未来几年新的行星将被科学家们发现。","usage":"will be + done + by 用来强调动作的执行者。","search":"new planets will be discovered by scientists in the coming years. 未来几年新的行星将被科学家们发现。 will be + done + by 用来强调动作的执行者。"},{"en":"Yang Liwei was the first Chinese astronaut who travelled into space.","cn":"杨利伟是第一位进入太空的中国航天员。","usage":"who 引导定语从句修饰 astronaut，使信息更丰富。","search":"yang liwei was the first chinese astronaut who travelled into space. 杨利伟是第一位进入太空的中国航天员。 who 引导定语从句修饰 astronaut，使信息更丰富。"},{"en":"Tiangong is the space station that China has built in space.","cn":"天宫是中国在太空建造的空间站。","usage":"that 引导定语从句修饰 the space station。","search":"tiangong is the space station that china has built in space. 天宫是中国在太空建造的空间站。 that 引导定语从句修饰 the space station。"},{"en":"Exploring space helps us learn more about the universe.","cn":"探索太空帮助我们更多地了解宇宙。","usage":"动名词短语作主语时，谓语动词用单数形式。","search":"exploring space helps us learn more about the universe. 探索太空帮助我们更多地了解宇宙。 动名词短语作主语时，谓语动词用单数形式。"},{"en":"We can not only see the Earth from space, but also learn how to live there.","cn":"我们不仅能在太空中看到地球，而且能学习如何在那里生活。","usage":"not only...but also... 连接两个并列成分，表达递进关系。","search":"we can not only see the earth from space, but also learn how to live there. 我们不仅能在太空中看到地球，而且能学习如何在那里生活。 not only...but also... 连接两个并列成分，表达递进关系。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u6-a1","unit":6,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"我的太空梦","enTitle":"My Space Dream","words":"约143词","wordsApprox":143,"paragraphs":["I have been interested in the stars since I was a little child. I dream of becoming an astronaut and travelling into space one day.","I know that making my dream come true is not easy. First, I must study hard, especially science and English. Second, I need to exercise every day to keep strong and healthy. I believe that if I never give up, my dream will come true.","In 2003, Yang Liwei became the first Chinese astronaut who travelled into space. His story makes me believe that nothing is impossible.","I hope that one day I will be sent to Tiangong, the space station which is flying high above the Earth. From there, I will be able to see our beautiful blue planet with my own eyes.","A dream is like a star, and I will work hard to reach it."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用现在完成时和 dream of doing 点明长期梦想，紧扣“太空梦”主题；2）用 who 和 which 两个定语从句分别介绍杨利伟与天宫空间站，句式多样、信息丰富；3）将来时被动语态 will be sent 与 hope that 从句结合，既落实本单元语法重点，又自然表达梦想。","highlight":"I hope that one day I will be sent to Tiangong, the space station which is flying high above the Earth.","highlightCn":"我希望有一天我能被送往天宫——那个正在地球上空飞行的空间站。"},"translation":null,"search":"我的太空梦 my space dream i have been interested in the stars since i was a little child. i dream of becoming an astronaut and travelling into space one day. i know that making my dream come true is not easy. first, i must study hard, especially science and english. second, i need to exercise every day to keep strong and healthy. i believe that if i never give up, my dream will come true. in 2003, yang liwei became the first chinese astronaut who travelled into space. his story makes me believe that nothing is impossible. i hope that one day i will be sent to tiangong, the space station which is flying high above the earth. from there, i will be able to see our beautiful blue planet with my own eyes. a dream is like a star, and i will work hard to reach it. 1）开篇用现在完成时和 dream of doing 点明长期梦想，紧扣“太空梦”主题；2）用 who 和 which 两个定语从句分别介绍杨利伟与天宫空间站，句式多样、信息丰富；3）将来时被动语态 will be sent 与 hope that 从句结合，既落实本单元语法重点，又自然表达梦想。 i hope that one day i will be sent to tiangong, the space station which is flying high above the earth. 我希望有一天我能被送往天宫——那个正在地球上空飞行的空间站。"},{"id":"u6-a2","unit":6,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"中国航天的成就","enTitle":"China's Space Achievements","words":"约141词","wordsApprox":141,"paragraphs":["In recent years, China has made great progress in space exploration, and I feel proud of my country.","In 2003, Yang Liwei travelled into space and became the first Chinese astronaut. His success showed the world that China could send people into space.","Today, Tiangong, China's own space station, is flying high above the Earth. Chinese astronauts live and work there, doing scientific experiments.","The Chang'e programme has helped us learn more about the Moon, and it will be continued in the future.","These achievements belong not only to the astronauts but also to all the scientists working hard behind them. They show us that if we keep trying, nothing is impossible.","I hope that more young people will be encouraged to study science, and I believe that more wonders of space will be discovered by scientists in the coming years."],"analysis":{"text":"1）按“杨利伟首次飞天、天宫空间站、嫦娥探月”的时间顺序组织材料，紧扣“成就”主题，思路清晰；2）将来时被动语态 will be continued、will be discovered by scientists 使用恰当，语法亮点突出；3）not only...but also... 与现在分词短语 working hard 并用，结尾展望未来，升华主题。","highlight":"I hope that more young people will be encouraged to study science, and I believe that more wonders of space will be discovered by scientists in the coming years.","highlightCn":"我希望更多的年轻人将被鼓励去学习科学，并且我相信未来几年将有更多太空的奥秘被科学家们发现。"},"translation":null,"search":"中国航天的成就 china's space achievements in recent years, china has made great progress in space exploration, and i feel proud of my country. in 2003, yang liwei travelled into space and became the first chinese astronaut. his success showed the world that china could send people into space. today, tiangong, china's own space station, is flying high above the earth. chinese astronauts live and work there, doing scientific experiments. the chang'e programme has helped us learn more about the moon, and it will be continued in the future. these achievements belong not only to the astronauts but also to all the scientists working hard behind them. they show us that if we keep trying, nothing is impossible. i hope that more young people will be encouraged to study science, and i believe that more wonders of space will be discovered by scientists in the coming years. 1）按“杨利伟首次飞天、天宫空间站、嫦娥探月”的时间顺序组织材料，紧扣“成就”主题，思路清晰；2）将来时被动语态 will be continued、will be discovered by scientists 使用恰当，语法亮点突出；3）not only...but also... 与现在分词短语 working hard 并用，结尾展望未来，升华主题。 i hope that more young people will be encouraged to study science, and i believe that more wonders of space will be discovered by scientists in the coming years. 我希望更多的年轻人将被鼓励去学习科学，并且我相信未来几年将有更多太空的奥秘被科学家们发现。"},{"id":"u6-a3","unit":6,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"太空站里的一天","enTitle":"A Day in the Space Station","words":"约143词","wordsApprox":143,"paragraphs":["Have you ever wondered what a day in a space station is like? Let me imagine a day on Tiangong, China's space station.","In the morning, astronauts get up and float to the window. Looking out, they can see the Earth far below.","After a simple breakfast, they begin their work. Some do scientific experiments, and others check the machines carefully.","Because there is no gravity, everything floats in the air, and astronauts must be careful. More food and water will be sent to them by spaceships.","In the afternoon, they exercise on special machines to keep their bodies strong.","In the evening, they talk with their families through video calls. At night, they sleep in sleeping bags which are tied to the walls.","A day in space is busy but full of surprises. I hope I can experience it myself one day."],"analysis":{"text":"1）以疑问句开头引出想象，再按早、中、晚的时间顺序展开，层次分明；2）非谓语动词 Looking out、定语从句 which are tied to the walls 与将来时被动语态 will be sent 综合运用，句式灵活；3）get up、float to、fly away 等动词短语生动描绘失重环境下的生活，画面感强。","highlight":"A day in space is busy but full of surprises.","highlightCn":"太空中的一天虽然忙碌，却充满惊喜。"},"translation":null,"search":"太空站里的一天 a day in the space station have you ever wondered what a day in a space station is like? let me imagine a day on tiangong, china's space station. in the morning, astronauts get up and float to the window. looking out, they can see the earth far below. after a simple breakfast, they begin their work. some do scientific experiments, and others check the machines carefully. because there is no gravity, everything floats in the air, and astronauts must be careful. more food and water will be sent to them by spaceships. in the afternoon, they exercise on special machines to keep their bodies strong. in the evening, they talk with their families through video calls. at night, they sleep in sleeping bags which are tied to the walls. a day in space is busy but full of surprises. i hope i can experience it myself one day. 1）以疑问句开头引出想象，再按早、中、晚的时间顺序展开，层次分明；2）非谓语动词 looking out、定语从句 which are tied to the walls 与将来时被动语态 will be sent 综合运用，句式灵活；3）get up、float to、fly away 等动词短语生动描绘失重环境下的生活，画面感强。 a day in space is busy but full of surprises. 太空中的一天虽然忙碌，却充满惊喜。"},{"id":"u6-a4","unit":6,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"我们为什么要探索太空","enTitle":"Why We Explore Space","words":"约142词","wordsApprox":142,"paragraphs":["Why do we spend so much money exploring space? In my opinion, space exploration is not a waste of money, because it brings us many benefits.","First, exploring space helps us learn more about our planet and the universe. Satellites help us forecast the weather and find our way.","Second, it pushes science and technology forward. Many inventions that were first used in space now serve our daily life.","Third, space exploration teaches us to dream big. Looking up at the stars, we realise how small we are, and we learn to protect our home, the Earth.","What is more, the future of humans may lie beyond the Earth. I believe that one day new homes will be built on other planets.","In a word, exploring space not only satisfies our curiosity but also creates a better future for all of us."],"analysis":{"text":"1）先设问后回答，开门见山亮明观点，议论文结构完整；2）First、Second、Third、What is more、In a word 层层推进，连接词使用恰当，逻辑严密；3）动名词作主语（exploring space）、定语从句（inventions that were first used in space）、将来时被动语态（new homes will be built）与 not only...but also... 综合运用，句型高级地道。","highlight":"In a word, exploring space not only satisfies our curiosity but also creates a better future for all of us.","highlightCn":"总之，探索太空不仅能满足我们的好奇心，还能为我们所有人创造更加美好的未来。"},"translation":null,"search":"我们为什么要探索太空 why we explore space why do we spend so much money exploring space? in my opinion, space exploration is not a waste of money, because it brings us many benefits. first, exploring space helps us learn more about our planet and the universe. satellites help us forecast the weather and find our way. second, it pushes science and technology forward. many inventions that were first used in space now serve our daily life. third, space exploration teaches us to dream big. looking up at the stars, we realise how small we are, and we learn to protect our home, the earth. what is more, the future of humans may lie beyond the earth. i believe that one day new homes will be built on other planets. in a word, exploring space not only satisfies our curiosity but also creates a better future for all of us. 1）先设问后回答，开门见山亮明观点，议论文结构完整；2）first、second、third、what is more、in a word 层层推进，连接词使用恰当，逻辑严密；3）动名词作主语（exploring space）、定语从句（inventions that were first used in space）、将来时被动语态（new homes will be built）与 not only...but also... 综合运用，句型高级地道。 in a word, exploring space not only satisfies our curiosity but also creates a better future for all of us. 总之，探索太空不仅能满足我们的好奇心，还能为我们所有人创造更加美好的未来。"},{"id":"u6-a5","unit":6,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"给航天员的一封信","enTitle":"A Letter to an Astronaut","words":"约143词","wordsApprox":143,"paragraphs":["Dear astronaut,","I am a student from Chengdu. I am writing to tell you how much I admire you.","When I saw the news that Chinese astronauts were working on Tiangong, I was deeply moved.","I dream of becoming an astronaut like you one day. I know the road is hard. Astronauts must study for many years, exercise every day and stay calm in any situation.","Could you please tell me what a real day on Tiangong is like? I also want to know what I should do now to get ready for my dream.","Your story encourages me to work hard every day. I hope that one day my dream will be realised, and I will be sent to the space station that our country built.","Please take care of yourself. I am looking forward to your reply.","Yours sincerely,","Li Hua"],"analysis":{"text":"1）书信格式完整，称呼、正文、结尾敬语与署名齐全，语气礼貌自然；2）dream of doing、Could you please tell me... 与将来时被动语态 will be realised、will be sent 紧扣单元语法，贴切得体；3）定语从句 that our country built 与宾语从句 what I should do 交织使用，句式丰富，情感真挚。","highlight":"I hope that one day my dream will be realised, and I will be sent to the space station that our country built.","highlightCn":"我希望有一天我的梦想能够实现，我能够被送往我们国家建造的空间站。"},"translation":null,"search":"给航天员的一封信 a letter to an astronaut dear astronaut, i am a student from chengdu. i am writing to tell you how much i admire you. when i saw the news that chinese astronauts were working on tiangong, i was deeply moved. i dream of becoming an astronaut like you one day. i know the road is hard. astronauts must study for many years, exercise every day and stay calm in any situation. could you please tell me what a real day on tiangong is like? i also want to know what i should do now to get ready for my dream. your story encourages me to work hard every day. i hope that one day my dream will be realised, and i will be sent to the space station that our country built. please take care of yourself. i am looking forward to your reply. yours sincerely, li hua 1）书信格式完整，称呼、正文、结尾敬语与署名齐全，语气礼貌自然；2）dream of doing、could you please tell me... 与将来时被动语态 will be realised、will be sent 紧扣单元语法，贴切得体；3）定语从句 that our country built 与宾语从句 what i should do 交织使用，句式丰富，情感真挚。 i hope that one day my dream will be realised, and i will be sent to the space station that our country built. 我希望有一天我的梦想能够实现，我能够被送往我们国家建造的空间站。"},{"id":"u6-b1","unit":6,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"我想成为一名航天员","enTitle":"I Want to Be an Astronaut","words":"约87词","wordsApprox":87,"paragraphs":["Everyone has a dream. My dream is to travel into space. I want to be an astronaut when I grow up.","First, I will study hard at school. Science and English are very important for me.","Second, I will do exercise every day. A good astronaut needs a strong body.","Finally, I will learn more about space. I often read books and watch videos about stars and planets.","I think my dream will come true one day. I hope I can see the beautiful Earth from space."],"analysis":null,"translation":"每个人都有梦想。我的梦想是去太空旅行。我长大后想成为一名航天员。首先，我会在学校努力学习。科学和英语对我来说非常重要。其次，我会每天锻炼身体。一名好的航天员需要强壮的身体。最后，我会更多地了解太空。我经常阅读关于恒星和行星的书籍、观看相关的视频。我认为我的梦想总有一天会实现。我希望我能从太空看到美丽的地球。","search":"我想成为一名航天员 i want to be an astronaut everyone has a dream. my dream is to travel into space. i want to be an astronaut when i grow up. first, i will study hard at school. science and english are very important for me. second, i will do exercise every day. a good astronaut needs a strong body. finally, i will learn more about space. i often read books and watch videos about stars and planets. i think my dream will come true one day. i hope i can see the beautiful earth from space. 每个人都有梦想。我的梦想是去太空旅行。我长大后想成为一名航天员。首先，我会在学校努力学习。科学和英语对我来说非常重要。其次，我会每天锻炼身体。一名好的航天员需要强壮的身体。最后，我会更多地了解太空。我经常阅读关于恒星和行星的书籍、观看相关的视频。我认为我的梦想总有一天会实现。我希望我能从太空看到美丽的地球。"},{"id":"u6-b2","unit":6,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"中国的太空探索","enTitle":"China's Space Exploration","words":"约87词","wordsApprox":87,"paragraphs":["Our country is doing great work in space exploration. I feel very proud of it.","First, in 2003, Yang Liwei went into space. He was the first Chinese astronaut.","Second, China has its own space station. It is called Tiangong. Chinese astronauts live and work in it. They do many experiments there.","Finally, China has a project called Chang'e. It helps us learn about the Moon.","I believe our country will do better in the future. I hope more young people will love space and study science."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我国在太空探索方面做得很好。我为此感到非常自豪。首先，2003年，杨利伟进入了太空。他是第一位中国航天员。其次，中国拥有自己的空间站。它叫天宫。中国航天员在里面生活和工作。他们在那里做很多实验。最后，中国有一个叫作“嫦娥”的工程。它帮助我们了解月球。我相信我们国家将来会做得更好。我希望更多的年轻人会热爱太空、学习科学。","search":"中国的太空探索 china's space exploration our country is doing great work in space exploration. i feel very proud of it. first, in 2003, yang liwei went into space. he was the first chinese astronaut. second, china has its own space station. it is called tiangong. chinese astronauts live and work in it. they do many experiments there. finally, china has a project called chang'e. it helps us learn about the moon. i believe our country will do better in the future. i hope more young people will love space and study science. 我国在太空探索方面做得很好。我为此感到非常自豪。首先，2003年，杨利伟进入了太空。他是第一位中国航天员。其次，中国拥有自己的空间站。它叫天宫。中国航天员在里面生活和工作。他们在那里做很多实验。最后，中国有一个叫作“嫦娥”的工程。它帮助我们了解月球。我相信我们国家将来会做得更好。我希望更多的年轻人会热爱太空、学习科学。"},{"id":"u6-b3","unit":6,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"太空站里的生活","enTitle":"Life in the Space Station","words":"约102词","wordsApprox":102,"paragraphs":["Life in the space station is different from life on the Earth. There is no gravity there.","First, astronauts cannot walk like us. They float in the air.","Second, eating is not easy. Food must be put in special bags, or it will fly away.","Finally, astronauts sleep in sleeping bags. The bags are tied to the walls, so they will not float at night.","But astronauts can see the beautiful Earth from the windows. I think life there is hard but interesting.","I hope one day I can live in the space station and see the Earth with my own eyes."],"analysis":null,"translation":"空间站里的生活和地球上的生活不一样。那里没有重力。首先，航天员不能像我们一样走路。他们在空中飘浮。其次，吃饭并不容易。食物必须装在特殊的袋子里，否则会飞走。最后，航天员睡在睡袋里。睡袋被系在墙上，所以夜里不会飘走。但是航天员能从窗户看到美丽的地球。我觉得那里的生活虽然艰苦但很有趣。我希望有一天我能住在空间站里，亲眼看到地球。","search":"太空站里的生活 life in the space station life in the space station is different from life on the earth. there is no gravity there. first, astronauts cannot walk like us. they float in the air. second, eating is not easy. food must be put in special bags, or it will fly away. finally, astronauts sleep in sleeping bags. the bags are tied to the walls, so they will not float at night. but astronauts can see the beautiful earth from the windows. i think life there is hard but interesting. i hope one day i can live in the space station and see the earth with my own eyes. 空间站里的生活和地球上的生活不一样。那里没有重力。首先，航天员不能像我们一样走路。他们在空中飘浮。其次，吃饭并不容易。食物必须装在特殊的袋子里，否则会飞走。最后，航天员睡在睡袋里。睡袋被系在墙上，所以夜里不会飘走。但是航天员能从窗户看到美丽的地球。我觉得那里的生活虽然艰苦但很有趣。我希望有一天我能住在空间站里，亲眼看到地球。"},{"id":"u6-b4","unit":6,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"月亮","enTitle":"The Moon","words":"约91词","wordsApprox":91,"paragraphs":["The Moon is the brightest thing in the night sky. It is our neighbour in space.","First, the Moon is much smaller than the Earth. There is no air or water on it.","Second, the Moon is very important for people. China has a project called Chang'e. It helps scientists learn about the Moon.","Finally, many people love the Moon. Poets write beautiful poems about it.","I believe the Moon is full of stories and dreams. I hope one day I can stand on it and look at our blue Earth."],"analysis":null,"translation":"月亮是夜空中最亮的东西。它是我们在太空中的邻居。首先，月亮比地球小得多。它上面没有空气和水。其次，月亮对人类非常重要。中国有一个叫作“嫦娥”的工程。它帮助科学家了解月球。最后，许多人喜爱月亮。诗人为它写下优美的诗篇。我相信月亮充满故事和梦想。我希望有一天我能站在月球上，望着我们蓝色的地球。","search":"月亮 the moon the moon is the brightest thing in the night sky. it is our neighbour in space. first, the moon is much smaller than the earth. there is no air or water on it. second, the moon is very important for people. china has a project called chang'e. it helps scientists learn about the moon. finally, many people love the moon. poets write beautiful poems about it. i believe the moon is full of stories and dreams. i hope one day i can stand on it and look at our blue earth. 月亮是夜空中最亮的东西。它是我们在太空中的邻居。首先，月亮比地球小得多。它上面没有空气和水。其次，月亮对人类非常重要。中国有一个叫作“嫦娥”的工程。它帮助科学家了解月球。最后，许多人喜爱月亮。诗人为它写下优美的诗篇。我相信月亮充满故事和梦想。我希望有一天我能站在月球上，望着我们蓝色的地球。"},{"id":"u6-b5","unit":6,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"航天英雄杨利伟","enTitle":"Yang Liwei, a Great Astronaut","words":"约94词","wordsApprox":94,"paragraphs":["Yang Liwei is a great Chinese astronaut. He is a hero in the hearts of many young people.","First, in 2003, Yang Liwei went into space. He was the first Chinese person to travel in space.","Second, flying in space is not easy. Yang Liwei trained very hard before his trip. He never gave up.","Finally, his success made all Chinese people proud. Many children want to be astronauts like him.","I think Yang Liwei is a true hero. I hope one day I can be an astronaut like him and fly into space."],"analysis":null,"translation":"杨利伟是一位伟大的中国航天员。他是许多年轻人心中的英雄。首先，2003年，杨利伟进入了太空。他是第一位进入太空旅行的中国人。其次，在太空飞行并不容易。杨利伟在出发前进行了刻苦的训练。他从不放弃。最后，他的成功让所有中国人感到骄傲。许多孩子想像他一样成为航天员。我认为杨利伟是真正的英雄。我希望有一天我能像他一样成为航天员，飞向太空。","search":"航天英雄杨利伟 yang liwei, a great astronaut yang liwei is a great chinese astronaut. he is a hero in the hearts of many young people. first, in 2003, yang liwei went into space. he was the first chinese person to travel in space. second, flying in space is not easy. yang liwei trained very hard before his trip. he never gave up. finally, his success made all chinese people proud. many children want to be astronauts like him. i think yang liwei is a true hero. i hope one day i can be an astronaut like him and fly into space. 杨利伟是一位伟大的中国航天员。他是许多年轻人心中的英雄。首先，2003年，杨利伟进入了太空。他是第一位进入太空旅行的中国人。其次，在太空飞行并不容易。杨利伟在出发前进行了刻苦的训练。他从不放弃。最后，他的成功让所有中国人感到骄傲。许多孩子想像他一样成为航天员。我认为杨利伟是真正的英雄。我希望有一天我能像他一样成为航天员，飞向太空。"}]},{"no":7,"enName":"Feel the Rhythm","cnName":"感受节奏","grammar":"定语从句（who / which / that / whose / when / where）","task":"My Music Story（我的音乐故事）","patterns":[{"en":"Chopin is a great musician who has encouraged millions of people.","cn":"肖邦是一位激励了千百万人的伟大音乐家。","usage":"who 引导定语从句，修饰先行词 a great musician，在从句中作主语，先行词指人时常用 who。","search":"chopin is a great musician who has encouraged millions of people. 肖邦是一位激励了千百万人的伟大音乐家。 who 引导定语从句，修饰先行词 a great musician，在从句中作主语，先行词指人时常用 who。"},{"en":"Music, which is a language without words, can be understood by everyone.","cn":"音乐是一种不用词语的语言，人人都能理解它。","usage":"which 引导非限制性定语从句，对先行词 music 作补充说明，从句前后用逗号与主句隔开。","search":"music, which is a language without words, can be understood by everyone. 音乐是一种不用词语的语言，人人都能理解它。 which 引导非限制性定语从句，对先行词 music 作补充说明，从句前后用逗号与主句隔开。"},{"en":"The song that I listen to every morning gives me energy for the whole day.","cn":"我每天早上听的那首歌给我一整天的活力。","usage":"that 引导定语从句，修饰先行词 the song，在从句中作宾语，先行词是物时可以用 that 替换 which。","search":"the song that i listen to every morning gives me energy for the whole day. 我每天早上听的那首歌给我一整天的活力。 that 引导定语从句，修饰先行词 the song，在从句中作宾语，先行词是物时可以用 that 替换 which。"},{"en":"I admire the composer whose music has the power to touch people's hearts.","cn":"我钦佩那位音乐能打动人心的作曲家。","usage":"whose 引导定语从句，表示所属关系，修饰先行词 the composer，相当于 the composer's music。","search":"i admire the composer whose music has the power to touch people's hearts. 我钦佩那位音乐能打动人心的作曲家。 whose 引导定语从句，表示所属关系，修饰先行词 the composer，相当于 the composer's music。"},{"en":"I will never forget the moment when the whole hall stood up and clapped.","cn":"我永远不会忘记整个大厅起立鼓掌的那一刻。","usage":"when 引导定语从句，修饰表示时间的先行词 the moment，在从句中作时间状语，相当于 at which。","search":"i will never forget the moment when the whole hall stood up and clapped. 我永远不会忘记整个大厅起立鼓掌的那一刻。 when 引导定语从句，修饰表示时间的先行词 the moment，在从句中作时间状语，相当于 at which。"},{"en":"Chengdu City Concert Hall is a wonderful place where music lovers can enjoy classical concerts.","cn":"成都城市音乐厅是一个音乐爱好者可以欣赏古典音乐会的绝佳场所。","usage":"where 引导定语从句，修饰表示地点的先行词 place，在从句中作地点状语，相当于 in which。","search":"chengdu city concert hall is a wonderful place where music lovers can enjoy classical concerts. 成都城市音乐厅是一个音乐爱好者可以欣赏古典音乐会的绝佳场所。 where 引导定语从句，修饰表示地点的先行词 place，在从句中作地点状语，相当于 in which。"},{"en":"My music teacher, who has played the piano for twenty years, often tells us stories about famous musicians.","cn":"我的音乐老师弹了二十年钢琴，她常给我们讲著名音乐家的故事。","usage":"who 引导非限制性定语从句，对先行词 my music teacher 作补充说明，此时不能用 that 替换 who。","search":"my music teacher, who has played the piano for twenty years, often tells us stories about famous musicians. 我的音乐老师弹了二十年钢琴，她常给我们讲著名音乐家的故事。 who 引导非限制性定语从句，对先行词 my music teacher 作补充说明，此时不能用 that 替换 who。"},{"en":"This is the most beautiful song that I have ever heard, which is why I listen to it again and again.","cn":"这是我所听过的最美的一首歌，因此我一遍又一遍地听它。","usage":"先行词被最高级修饰时，定语从句只能用 that；后面的 which 引导非限制性定语从句，指代前面整个句子。","search":"this is the most beautiful song that i have ever heard, which is why i listen to it again and again. 这是我所听过的最美的一首歌，因此我一遍又一遍地听它。 先行词被最高级修饰时，定语从句只能用 that；后面的 which 引导非限制性定语从句，指代前面整个句子。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u7-a1","unit":7,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"我的音乐故事","enTitle":"My Music Story","words":"约144词","wordsApprox":144,"paragraphs":["Music has been my closest friend since I was a little girl. The person who first brought music to me was my grandmother, whose soft songs helped me fall asleep every night. When I was nine, I got a small guitar, which soon became my favourite thing.","As I grew up, music became a way for me to express my feelings. Whenever I feel tired after a day of study, I pick up my guitar and play a few songs that I have written myself. Last month, my friends and I played at the school art festival. The moment when the whole hall began to clap was the proudest moment of my life.","Music, which never asks for anything but always gives me warmth, has taught me to face difficulties with a smile. I believe it will stay with me for my whole life."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用现在完成时 Music has been my closest friend 点明音乐与我的关系，The person who first brought music to me 用 who 引导的定语从句引出奶奶，情感真挚；2）第二段按时间顺序推进，that I have written myself 等定语从句让叙述自然流畅，The moment when the whole hall began to clap 又用 when 引导的定语从句定格最自豪的瞬间；3）结尾 which never asks for anything but always gives me warmth 用非限制性定语从句总结音乐的意义，升华主题。","highlight":"Music, which never asks for anything but always gives me warmth, has taught me to face difficulties with a smile.","highlightCn":"音乐从不索取，却总是给我温暖，它教会我笑着面对困难。"},"translation":null,"search":"我的音乐故事 my music story music has been my closest friend since i was a little girl. the person who first brought music to me was my grandmother, whose soft songs helped me fall asleep every night. when i was nine, i got a small guitar, which soon became my favourite thing. as i grew up, music became a way for me to express my feelings. whenever i feel tired after a day of study, i pick up my guitar and play a few songs that i have written myself. last month, my friends and i played at the school art festival. the moment when the whole hall began to clap was the proudest moment of my life. music, which never asks for anything but always gives me warmth, has taught me to face difficulties with a smile. i believe it will stay with me for my whole life. 1）开篇用现在完成时 music has been my closest friend 点明音乐与我的关系，the person who first brought music to me 用 who 引导的定语从句引出奶奶，情感真挚；2）第二段按时间顺序推进，that i have written myself 等定语从句让叙述自然流畅，the moment when the whole hall began to clap 又用 when 引导的定语从句定格最自豪的瞬间；3）结尾 which never asks for anything but always gives me warmth 用非限制性定语从句总结音乐的意义，升华主题。 music, which never asks for anything but always gives me warmth, has taught me to face difficulties with a smile. 音乐从不索取，却总是给我温暖，它教会我笑着面对困难。"},{"id":"u7-a2","unit":7,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"我最喜欢的一首歌","enTitle":"My Favourite Song","words":"约144词","wordsApprox":144,"paragraphs":["Among all the songs I have heard, the one that touches me most is Heal the World by Michael Jackson. I first listened to it in Grade Seven, and it has stayed in my heart ever since.","What makes this song special is not only its gentle melody but also its message. The lyrics, which are simple but warm, encourage people to care for children and the planet. Michael Jackson, who devoted much of his life to charity, believed that music could bring people together. Every time I hear the line “make a better place for you and for me”, I feel a strong wish to do something helpful.","This is the song that has taught me to be kind and hopeful. I often share it with my friends, and I hope more people will join hands to make our world a better place."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用 the one that touches me most 中 that 引导的定语从句开门见山地点出最爱的一首歌，Among all the songs I have heard 作背景铺垫；2）The lyrics, which are simple but warm 与 Michael Jackson, who devoted much of his life to charity 两处定语从句分别补充说明歌词与歌手，使介绍更有层次；3）结尾 This is the song that has taught me to be kind and hopeful 再用定语从句收束全文，并发出分享音乐的号召，主题积极向上。","highlight":"The lyrics, which are simple but warm, encourage people to care for children and the planet.","highlightCn":"歌词简单却温暖，鼓励人们关爱儿童、关爱地球。"},"translation":null,"search":"我最喜欢的一首歌 my favourite song among all the songs i have heard, the one that touches me most is heal the world by michael jackson. i first listened to it in grade seven, and it has stayed in my heart ever since. what makes this song special is not only its gentle melody but also its message. the lyrics, which are simple but warm, encourage people to care for children and the planet. michael jackson, who devoted much of his life to charity, believed that music could bring people together. every time i hear the line “make a better place for you and for me”, i feel a strong wish to do something helpful. this is the song that has taught me to be kind and hopeful. i often share it with my friends, and i hope more people will join hands to make our world a better place. 1）开篇用 the one that touches me most 中 that 引导的定语从句开门见山地点出最爱的一首歌，among all the songs i have heard 作背景铺垫；2）the lyrics, which are simple but warm 与 michael jackson, who devoted much of his life to charity 两处定语从句分别补充说明歌词与歌手，使介绍更有层次；3）结尾 this is the song that has taught me to be kind and hopeful 再用定语从句收束全文，并发出分享音乐的号召，主题积极向上。 the lyrics, which are simple but warm, encourage people to care for children and the planet. 歌词简单却温暖，鼓励人们关爱儿童、关爱地球。"},{"id":"u7-a3","unit":7,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"肖邦，给我力量的音乐家","enTitle":"Chopin, My Great Inspiration","words":"约147词","wordsApprox":147,"paragraphs":["The musician who gives me strength is Frederic Chopin. Born in Poland over two hundred years ago, he is a great composer whose music has moved people all over the world.","I first heard Chopin's music in my piano class. My teacher asked me to play a short piece that he wrote when he was young. The notes are simple, but the music is full of feeling. He left his homeland and lived in France, but he never stopped loving Poland. The music that he created in his hardest days still sounds full of hope.","Last term, I did badly in an exam and almost gave up playing the piano. That night I listened to Chopin's Nocturne, which calmed me down and gave me courage. Thanks to him, I have learned that difficulties are like low notes in a song: they make the beautiful parts even sweeter."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头 The musician who gives me strength is 用 who 引导的定语从句直接扣题，whose music has moved people 进一步说明肖邦的影响力；2）第二段用 that he wrote、that he created 等定语从句介绍肖邦的作品与经历，The notes are simple, but the music is full of feeling 用转折突出他作品中蕴含的力量；3）结尾 Chopin's Nocturne, which calmed me down and gave me courage 用非限制性定语从句写出音乐给我的具体帮助，最后以 difficulties are like low notes in a song 的比喻升华主题。","highlight":"That night I listened to Chopin's Nocturne, which calmed me down and gave me courage.","highlightCn":"那天晚上我听了肖邦的夜曲，它让我平静下来，并给了我勇气。"},"translation":null,"search":"肖邦，给我力量的音乐家 chopin, my great inspiration the musician who gives me strength is frederic chopin. born in poland over two hundred years ago, he is a great composer whose music has moved people all over the world. i first heard chopin's music in my piano class. my teacher asked me to play a short piece that he wrote when he was young. the notes are simple, but the music is full of feeling. he left his homeland and lived in france, but he never stopped loving poland. the music that he created in his hardest days still sounds full of hope. last term, i did badly in an exam and almost gave up playing the piano. that night i listened to chopin's nocturne, which calmed me down and gave me courage. thanks to him, i have learned that difficulties are like low notes in a song: they make the beautiful parts even sweeter. 1）开头 the musician who gives me strength is 用 who 引导的定语从句直接扣题，whose music has moved people 进一步说明肖邦的影响力；2）第二段用 that he wrote、that he created 等定语从句介绍肖邦的作品与经历，the notes are simple, but the music is full of feeling 用转折突出他作品中蕴含的力量；3）结尾 chopin's nocturne, which calmed me down and gave me courage 用非限制性定语从句写出音乐给我的具体帮助，最后以 difficulties are like low notes in a song 的比喻升华主题。 that night i listened to chopin's nocturne, which calmed me down and gave me courage. 那天晚上我听了肖邦的夜曲，它让我平静下来，并给了我勇气。"},{"id":"u7-a4","unit":7,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"难忘的音乐会","enTitle":"An Unforgettable Concert","words":"约139词","wordsApprox":139,"paragraphs":["Last Saturday, my parents took me to a concert at Chengdu City Concert Hall, a modern building that stands near the Sichuan Conservatory of Music. It was my first time to enjoy a classical concert in such a wonderful place.","The hall was full of excited listeners. A young pianist, who had just come back from abroad, played several famous pieces. The most unforgettable was a piece by Chopin, whose soft and beautiful notes seemed to carry us to another world. When the music stopped, the whole hall was silent for a moment, and then people stood up and clapped for a long time.","On the way home, I kept thinking about what the pianist had said: “Music is a language that everyone can understand.” This concert, which I will never forget, has made me love music even more."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇交代时间、地点与事件，a modern building that stands near the Sichuan Conservatory of Music 用 that 引导的定语从句自然融入成都城市音乐厅这一地标；2）A young pianist, who had just come back from abroad 与 whose soft and beautiful notes 两处定语从句分别描写钢琴家与琴声，细节生动；3）结尾用钢琴家的话 Music is a language that everyone can understand 点出中心，再用 This concert, which I will never forget 非限制性定语从句收束，首尾呼应。","highlight":"The most unforgettable was a piece by Chopin, whose soft and beautiful notes seemed to carry us to another world.","highlightCn":"最难忘的是肖邦的一首曲子，它柔和优美的音符仿佛把我们带到了另一个世界。"},"translation":null,"search":"难忘的音乐会 an unforgettable concert last saturday, my parents took me to a concert at chengdu city concert hall, a modern building that stands near the sichuan conservatory of music. it was my first time to enjoy a classical concert in such a wonderful place. the hall was full of excited listeners. a young pianist, who had just come back from abroad, played several famous pieces. the most unforgettable was a piece by chopin, whose soft and beautiful notes seemed to carry us to another world. when the music stopped, the whole hall was silent for a moment, and then people stood up and clapped for a long time. on the way home, i kept thinking about what the pianist had said: “music is a language that everyone can understand.” this concert, which i will never forget, has made me love music even more. 1）开篇交代时间、地点与事件，a modern building that stands near the sichuan conservatory of music 用 that 引导的定语从句自然融入成都城市音乐厅这一地标；2）a young pianist, who had just come back from abroad 与 whose soft and beautiful notes 两处定语从句分别描写钢琴家与琴声，细节生动；3）结尾用钢琴家的话 music is a language that everyone can understand 点出中心，再用 this concert, which i will never forget 非限制性定语从句收束，首尾呼应。 the most unforgettable was a piece by chopin, whose soft and beautiful notes seemed to carry us to another world. 最难忘的是肖邦的一首曲子，它柔和优美的音符仿佛把我们带到了另一个世界。"},{"id":"u7-a5","unit":7,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"音乐让生活更美好","enTitle":"Music Makes Life Better","words":"约143词","wordsApprox":143,"paragraphs":["Good morning, everyone! Today I want to talk about something that makes life more beautiful: music.","Music is everywhere in our daily life. It can cheer us up when we are sad and calm us down when we are nervous. In Chengdu, music is especially close to us. In People's Park, we often hear old people playing the erhu, whose music sounds warm and peaceful. In Kuanzhai Alley, singers sing songs that make visitors stop and smile.","Music also brings people together. At the art festival last month, our class sang a Chinese song which we practised for weeks. Although we did not win first prize, we felt proud of our work.","I hope you can find a song, a singer or a piece of music that gives you strength. Let music be your friend, and you will find life full of rhythm."],"analysis":{"text":"1）演讲稿开头 Good morning, everyone! 与 Today I want to talk about... 符合演讲文体，something that makes life more beautiful 用定语从句点明主题；2）第二段用 whose music sounds warm and peaceful 和 that make visitors stop and smile 两处定语从句描写人民公园与宽窄巷子的音乐场景，成都元素自然融入；3）结尾 Let music be your friend, and you will find life full of rhythm 用祈使句加并列结构发出号召，把演讲推向高潮。","highlight":"In People's Park, we often hear old people playing the erhu, whose music sounds warm and peaceful.","highlightCn":"在人民公园，我们常听到老人们拉二胡，那音乐听起来温暖而宁静。"},"translation":null,"search":"音乐让生活更美好 music makes life better good morning, everyone! today i want to talk about something that makes life more beautiful: music. music is everywhere in our daily life. it can cheer us up when we are sad and calm us down when we are nervous. in chengdu, music is especially close to us. in people's park, we often hear old people playing the erhu, whose music sounds warm and peaceful. in kuanzhai alley, singers sing songs that make visitors stop and smile. music also brings people together. at the art festival last month, our class sang a chinese song which we practised for weeks. although we did not win first prize, we felt proud of our work. i hope you can find a song, a singer or a piece of music that gives you strength. let music be your friend, and you will find life full of rhythm. 1）演讲稿开头 good morning, everyone! 与 today i want to talk about... 符合演讲文体，something that makes life more beautiful 用定语从句点明主题；2）第二段用 whose music sounds warm and peaceful 和 that make visitors stop and smile 两处定语从句描写人民公园与宽窄巷子的音乐场景，成都元素自然融入；3）结尾 let music be your friend, and you will find life full of rhythm 用祈使句加并列结构发出号召，把演讲推向高潮。 in people's park, we often hear old people playing the erhu, whose music sounds warm and peaceful. 在人民公园，我们常听到老人们拉二胡，那音乐听起来温暖而宁静。"},{"id":"u7-b1","unit":7,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"音乐与我","enTitle":"Music and Me","words":"约89词","wordsApprox":89,"paragraphs":["Music is an important part of my life. I listen to music almost every day, and it always makes me feel better.","When I was small, my mother often sang soft songs to me at bedtime. Now I like pop music. My favourite singer is Zhou Shen, whose voice is clear and special. I often sing his songs with my classmates on the way home. Last year, I joined the school music club, which helped me make many new friends.","Music makes me happy. I will always love it."],"analysis":null,"translation":"音乐是我生活中重要的一部分。我几乎每天都听音乐，它总是让我感觉更好。小时候，妈妈常常在睡前给我唱轻柔的歌。现在我喜欢流行音乐。我最喜欢的歌手是周深，他的嗓音清澈而特别。我常常在回家的路上和同学们一起唱他的歌。去年，我加入了学校音乐社团，它帮我交到了许多新朋友。音乐让我快乐。我会永远热爱音乐。","search":"音乐与我 music and me music is an important part of my life. i listen to music almost every day, and it always makes me feel better. when i was small, my mother often sang soft songs to me at bedtime. now i like pop music. my favourite singer is zhou shen, whose voice is clear and special. i often sing his songs with my classmates on the way home. last year, i joined the school music club, which helped me make many new friends. music makes me happy. i will always love it. 音乐是我生活中重要的一部分。我几乎每天都听音乐，它总是让我感觉更好。小时候，妈妈常常在睡前给我唱轻柔的歌。现在我喜欢流行音乐。我最喜欢的歌手是周深，他的嗓音清澈而特别。我常常在回家的路上和同学们一起唱他的歌。去年，我加入了学校音乐社团，它帮我交到了许多新朋友。音乐让我快乐。我会永远热爱音乐。"},{"id":"u7-b2","unit":7,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"给我力量的一首歌","enTitle":"A Song That Gives Me Strength","words":"约97词","wordsApprox":97,"paragraphs":["My favourite song is You Raise Me Up. It is a song that gives me strength.","I first heard it in a music class. The song tells us that we should be brave when we meet difficulties. The music is soft and beautiful, and the singer's voice is full of feeling. When I feel tired or sad, I listen to it. It seems to say to me, “You can do it!” In spring, I often listen to it along the Tianfu Greenway, whose flowers make me feel relaxed.","This is the song that I will never forget."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我最喜欢的歌是《You Raise Me Up》。这是一首给我力量的歌。我第一次听到它是在一节音乐课上。这首歌告诉我们，遇到困难时应该勇敢。音乐轻柔优美，歌手的嗓音充满感情。当我感到疲惫或难过时，我就会听它。它似乎在对我说话：“你能做到！”春天，我常常沿着天府绿道听这首歌，那里的花儿让我感到放松。这就是我永远不会忘记的那首歌。","search":"给我力量的一首歌 a song that gives me strength my favourite song is you raise me up. it is a song that gives me strength. i first heard it in a music class. the song tells us that we should be brave when we meet difficulties. the music is soft and beautiful, and the singer's voice is full of feeling. when i feel tired or sad, i listen to it. it seems to say to me, “you can do it!” in spring, i often listen to it along the tianfu greenway, whose flowers make me feel relaxed. this is the song that i will never forget. 我最喜欢的歌是《you raise me up》。这是一首给我力量的歌。我第一次听到它是在一节音乐课上。这首歌告诉我们，遇到困难时应该勇敢。音乐轻柔优美，歌手的嗓音充满感情。当我感到疲惫或难过时，我就会听它。它似乎在对我说话：“你能做到！”春天，我常常沿着天府绿道听这首歌，那里的花儿让我感到放松。这就是我永远不会忘记的那首歌。"},{"id":"u7-b3","unit":7,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"给我力量的音乐家贝多芬","enTitle":"The Musician Who Gives Me Strength","words":"约90词","wordsApprox":90,"paragraphs":["The musician who gives me strength is Beethoven. He was a great German composer.","Beethoven began to lose his hearing in his twenties, but he did not give up. He wrote many great pieces when he was deaf. His music shows that a person can be strong even in difficult times. When I meet problems in my studies, I listen to his music, which makes me feel brave again.","Beethoven has taught me that we should never give up. His music will always be with me and give me courage."],"analysis":null,"translation":"给我力量的音乐家是贝多芬。他是一位伟大的德国作曲家。贝多芬二十多岁时开始失去听力，但他没有放弃。他在失聪的时候写出了许多伟大的作品。他的音乐表明，一个人即使在困难时期也可以很坚强。当我在学习中遇到问题时，我会听他的音乐，它让我再次感到勇敢。贝多芬教会了我永远不要放弃。他的音乐将永远陪伴着我，给我勇气。","search":"给我力量的音乐家贝多芬 the musician who gives me strength the musician who gives me strength is beethoven. he was a great german composer. beethoven began to lose his hearing in his twenties, but he did not give up. he wrote many great pieces when he was deaf. his music shows that a person can be strong even in difficult times. when i meet problems in my studies, i listen to his music, which makes me feel brave again. beethoven has taught me that we should never give up. his music will always be with me and give me courage. 给我力量的音乐家是贝多芬。他是一位伟大的德国作曲家。贝多芬二十多岁时开始失去听力，但他没有放弃。他在失聪的时候写出了许多伟大的作品。他的音乐表明，一个人即使在困难时期也可以很坚强。当我在学习中遇到问题时，我会听他的音乐，它让我再次感到勇敢。贝多芬教会了我永远不要放弃。他的音乐将永远陪伴着我，给我勇气。"},{"id":"u7-b4","unit":7,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"一场难忘的音乐会","enTitle":"A Concert to Remember","words":"约90词","wordsApprox":90,"paragraphs":["Last month, I went to a concert with my sister. It was the best concert that I had ever been to.","The concert was in Chengdu City Concert Hall, which is a beautiful place like a big glass box. We listened to many Chinese songs. The singer was a young man who came from Sichuan. He sang with great feeling, and the whole hall was excited. When he sang an old song that we all knew, everybody sang together.","I will remember this concert forever. Music really makes people closer."],"analysis":null,"translation":"上个月，我和姐姐去听了一场音乐会。那是我去过的最棒的音乐会。音乐会是在成都城市音乐厅举行的，它像一个漂亮的大玻璃盒子。我们听了很多中文歌曲。歌手是一位来自四川的年轻人。他唱得很有感情，整个大厅都很兴奋。当他唱起一首我们都熟悉的老歌时，大家一起唱了起来。我会永远记住这场音乐会。音乐真的让人们更亲近。","search":"一场难忘的音乐会 a concert to remember last month, i went to a concert with my sister. it was the best concert that i had ever been to. the concert was in chengdu city concert hall, which is a beautiful place like a big glass box. we listened to many chinese songs. the singer was a young man who came from sichuan. he sang with great feeling, and the whole hall was excited. when he sang an old song that we all knew, everybody sang together. i will remember this concert forever. music really makes people closer. 上个月，我和姐姐去听了一场音乐会。那是我去过的最棒的音乐会。音乐会是在成都城市音乐厅举行的，它像一个漂亮的大玻璃盒子。我们听了很多中文歌曲。歌手是一位来自四川的年轻人。他唱得很有感情，整个大厅都很兴奋。当他唱起一首我们都熟悉的老歌时，大家一起唱了起来。我会永远记住这场音乐会。音乐真的让人们更亲近。"},{"id":"u7-b5","unit":7,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"我身边的中国音乐","enTitle":"Chinese Music Around Me","words":"约89词","wordsApprox":89,"paragraphs":["There is music all around us in China. I love Chinese music very much.","My grandfather often plays the erhu at home. The erhu is a Chinese instrument that has a long history. Its music sounds soft and moving. In People's Park, I often see old people playing the erhu and singing, and many people stop to listen. I also like Chinese pop songs which mix traditional music with modern sounds.","Chinese music is a treasure of our culture. I hope more and more young people will love it."],"analysis":null,"translation":"在中国，我们身边到处都有音乐。我非常喜欢中国音乐。我的爷爷经常在家里拉二胡。二胡是一种历史悠久的中国乐器。它的音乐听起来柔和感人。在人民公园，我常常看到老人们拉二胡、唱歌，很多人停下来听。我也喜欢把传统音乐和现代声音融合在一起的中文流行歌曲。中国音乐是我们文化的瑰宝。我希望越来越多的年轻人喜欢它。","search":"我身边的中国音乐 chinese music around me there is music all around us in china. i love chinese music very much. my grandfather often plays the erhu at home. the erhu is a chinese instrument that has a long history. its music sounds soft and moving. in people's park, i often see old people playing the erhu and singing, and many people stop to listen. i also like chinese pop songs which mix traditional music with modern sounds. chinese music is a treasure of our culture. i hope more and more young people will love it. 在中国，我们身边到处都有音乐。我非常喜欢中国音乐。我的爷爷经常在家里拉二胡。二胡是一种历史悠久的中国乐器。它的音乐听起来柔和感人。在人民公园，我常常看到老人们拉二胡、唱歌，很多人停下来听。我也喜欢把传统音乐和现代声音融合在一起的中文流行歌曲。中国音乐是我们文化的瑰宝。我希望越来越多的年轻人喜欢它。"}]},{"no":8,"enName":"More than a Game","cnName":"不止是一场比赛","grammar":"主谓一致（subject-verb agreement）","task":"An Admirable Athlete（一位令人敬佩的运动员）","patterns":[{"en":"Playing team sports is a good way to make friends.","cn":"参加团队运动是交朋友的好方式。","usage":"动名词短语 Playing team sports 作主语时视为单数，谓语动词用 is，这是主谓一致最基本的规则之一。","search":"playing team sports is a good way to make friends. 参加团队运动是交朋友的好方式。 动名词短语 playing team sports 作主语时视为单数，谓语动词用 is，这是主谓一致最基本的规则之一。"},{"en":"To become a professional player takes years of hard training.","cn":"成为一名职业运动员需要多年的刻苦训练。","usage":"不定式短语 To become a professional player 作主语时，谓语动词用单数 takes，符合主谓一致的要求。","search":"to become a professional player takes years of hard training. 成为一名职业运动员需要多年的刻苦训练。 不定式短语 to become a professional player 作主语时，谓语动词用单数 takes，符合主谓一致的要求。"},{"en":"Either your parents or your coach has to sign the form.","cn":"要么你的父母，要么你的教练必须在表格上签字。","usage":"either...or... 连接两个主语时遵循就近原则，谓语与最近的 your coach 保持一致，用 has，这是主谓一致的常考规则。","search":"either your parents or your coach has to sign the form. 要么你的父母，要么你的教练必须在表格上签字。 either...or... 连接两个主语时遵循就近原则，谓语与最近的 your coach 保持一致，用 has，这是主谓一致的常考规则。"},{"en":"Neither the players nor the coach was happy with the result.","cn":"队员们和教练对比赛结果都不满意。","usage":"neither...nor... 连接并列主语时采用就近原则，谓语与最近的 the coach 一致，用单数 was，体现主谓一致。","search":"neither the players nor the coach was happy with the result. 队员们和教练对比赛结果都不满意。 neither...nor... 连接并列主语时采用就近原则，谓语与最近的 the coach 一致，用单数 was，体现主谓一致。"},{"en":"Not only the students but also their teacher is excited about the school sports meeting.","cn":"不仅学生们，他们的老师也对学校运动会感到兴奋。","usage":"not only...but also... 连接主语时遵循就近原则，谓语与 their teacher 保持一致，用 is，是主谓一致的重要考点。","search":"not only the students but also their teacher is excited about the school sports meeting. 不仅学生们，他们的老师也对学校运动会感到兴奋。 not only...but also... 连接主语时遵循就近原则，谓语与 their teacher 保持一致，用 is，是主谓一致的重要考点。"},{"en":"There is a running track and two basketball courts in our school.","cn":"我们学校有一条跑道和两个篮球场。","usage":"there be 句型遵循就近原则，谓语动词与最近的主语 a running track 保持一致，用 is，属于主谓一致的常考句型。","search":"there is a running track and two basketball courts in our school. 我们学校有一条跑道和两个篮球场。 there be 句型遵循就近原则，谓语动词与最近的主语 a running track 保持一致，用 is，属于主谓一致的常考句型。"},{"en":"A number of students are training hard for the sports meeting, and the number of volunteers is growing.","cn":"许多学生正在为运动会刻苦训练，志愿者的数量也在增加。","usage":"a number of 意为“许多”，谓语用复数 are；the number of 意为“……的数量”，中心词是 number，谓语用单数 is，这一对比是主谓一致的高频易错点。","search":"a number of students are training hard for the sports meeting, and the number of volunteers is growing. 许多学生正在为运动会刻苦训练，志愿者的数量也在增加。 a number of 意为“许多”，谓语用复数 are；the number of 意为“……的数量”，中心词是 number，谓语用单数 is，这一对比是主谓一致的高频易错点。"},{"en":"Our class is going to cheer for the runners, and each student has prepared a small flag.","cn":"我们班将去为跑步的同学们加油，每个学生都准备了一面小旗。","usage":"集合名词 class 作为一个整体作主语时谓语用单数 is；each 加单数名词作主语时谓语也用单数 has，二者都是主谓一致的常见考点。","search":"our class is going to cheer for the runners, and each student has prepared a small flag. 我们班将去为跑步的同学们加油，每个学生都准备了一面小旗。 集合名词 class 作为一个整体作主语时谓语用单数 is；each 加单数名词作主语时谓语也用单数 has，二者都是主谓一致的常见考点。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u8-a1","unit":8,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"学校运动会","enTitle":"The School Sports Meeting","words":"约139词","wordsApprox":139,"paragraphs":["Our school sports meeting was held at Fenghuangshan Sports Park last Friday, and it was an unforgettable day for all of us.","Early in the morning, all the students arrived at the stadium excitedly. The opening ceremony was short but wonderful, and our class marched in with bright flags. Then the competitions began. Taking part in the relay race was the most exciting part for me, and every runner in our team tried his best. Our class won two first prizes, which made us cheer loudly. What impressed me most was not the result but the spirit. When a boy from Class 5 fell down, several students from other classes ran to help him. In my opinion, taking part is much more important than winning.","The sports meeting taught me that teamwork and friendship are more than a game."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇交代运动会的时间与地点，并点出凤凰山体育公园这一成都元素，自然亲切；2）中间段落按“开幕式—比赛—暖心瞬间”的顺序推进，Taking part in the relay race was... 用动名词作主语、谓语用单数，every runner... tried his best 中 every 加单数名词与谓语保持一致，多处体现主谓一致；3）结尾 teamwork and friendship are more than a game 用复数主语与 are 呼应，点明“体育不止是一场比赛”的主题，升华自然。","highlight":"Taking part in the relay race was the most exciting part for me, and every runner in our team tried his best.","highlightCn":"对我来说，参加接力赛是最激动人心的部分，我们队的每个队员都尽了最大努力。"},"translation":null,"search":"学校运动会 the school sports meeting our school sports meeting was held at fenghuangshan sports park last friday, and it was an unforgettable day for all of us. early in the morning, all the students arrived at the stadium excitedly. the opening ceremony was short but wonderful, and our class marched in with bright flags. then the competitions began. taking part in the relay race was the most exciting part for me, and every runner in our team tried his best. our class won two first prizes, which made us cheer loudly. what impressed me most was not the result but the spirit. when a boy from class 5 fell down, several students from other classes ran to help him. in my opinion, taking part is much more important than winning. the sports meeting taught me that teamwork and friendship are more than a game. 1）开篇交代运动会的时间与地点，并点出凤凰山体育公园这一成都元素，自然亲切；2）中间段落按“开幕式—比赛—暖心瞬间”的顺序推进，taking part in the relay race was... 用动名词作主语、谓语用单数，every runner... tried his best 中 every 加单数名词与谓语保持一致，多处体现主谓一致；3）结尾 teamwork and friendship are more than a game 用复数主语与 are 呼应，点明“体育不止是一场比赛”的主题，升华自然。 taking part in the relay race was the most exciting part for me, and every runner in our team tried his best. 对我来说，参加接力赛是最激动人心的部分，我们队的每个队员都尽了最大努力。"},{"id":"u8-a2","unit":8,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"接力赛现场报道","enTitle":"A Report on the Relay Race","words":"约135词","wordsApprox":135,"paragraphs":["Good afternoon, everyone. This is Li Hua, reporting live from our school track. The 4×100-metre relay race is going on right now.","Eight classes are taking part in the final, and the runners are standing at their positions. Neither the athletes nor the coach looks calm at this moment. At the sound of the gun, the first runners rush out like arrows. Now Class 2 and Class 6 are neck and neck. Not only the runners but also their classmates are cheering loudly. Either Class 3 or Class 6 will get the gold medal. The last runner of Class 3 is catching up fast. He crosses the line first, and the whole playground cheers.","What a wonderful race! Sports bring us so much joy and energy. This is Li Hua, reporting from the school track."],"analysis":{"text":"1）以现场报道的口吻开篇，交代报道人、地点与比赛项目，代入感强；2）中间段落按“起跑—并驾齐驱—冲刺—夺冠”的现场顺序推进，Neither the athletes nor the coach looks calm 体现 neither...nor... 的就近原则，Not only the runners but also their classmates are cheering 体现 not only...but also... 的就近原则，主谓一致运用准确；3）结尾 What a wonderful race! 感叹收束，Sports bring us... 中复数主语与 bring 呼应，同样体现主谓一致，点出体育带来的快乐与力量。","highlight":"Neither the athletes nor the coach looks calm at this moment.","highlightCn":"此时此刻，无论是运动员们还是教练都无法平静。"},"translation":null,"search":"接力赛现场报道 a report on the relay race good afternoon, everyone. this is li hua, reporting live from our school track. the 4×100-metre relay race is going on right now. eight classes are taking part in the final, and the runners are standing at their positions. neither the athletes nor the coach looks calm at this moment. at the sound of the gun, the first runners rush out like arrows. now class 2 and class 6 are neck and neck. not only the runners but also their classmates are cheering loudly. either class 3 or class 6 will get the gold medal. the last runner of class 3 is catching up fast. he crosses the line first, and the whole playground cheers. what a wonderful race! sports bring us so much joy and energy. this is li hua, reporting from the school track. 1）以现场报道的口吻开篇，交代报道人、地点与比赛项目，代入感强；2）中间段落按“起跑—并驾齐驱—冲刺—夺冠”的现场顺序推进，neither the athletes nor the coach looks calm 体现 neither...nor... 的就近原则，not only the runners but also their classmates are cheering 体现 not only...but also... 的就近原则，主谓一致运用准确；3）结尾 what a wonderful race! 感叹收束，sports bring us... 中复数主语与 bring 呼应，同样体现主谓一致，点出体育带来的快乐与力量。 neither the athletes nor the coach looks calm at this moment. 此时此刻，无论是运动员们还是教练都无法平静。"},{"id":"u8-a3","unit":8,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"我最敬佩的运动员苏炳添","enTitle":"Su Bingtian, the Athlete I Admire Most","words":"约141词","wordsApprox":141,"paragraphs":["Among all the athletes I know, Su Bingtian is the one I admire most. People call him the fastest man in Asia.","In 2021, Su Bingtian ran 100 metres in 9.83 seconds at the Tokyo Olympics. To achieve this, he trained for many years. Every day he got up early and practised running again and again. He never gave up when he was tired or hurt. Because of his hard work, he broke the Asian record and became a hero in China. What impresses me most is his modesty. He often says that his success belongs to the whole team, not only to himself. His story tells me that hard work always pays off.","Su Bingtian is more than a great runner. He has set a good example for young people, and I will learn from him and keep working hard."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇用 Among all the athletes I know... 引出我最敬佩的运动员苏炳添，并用 the fastest man in Asia 点明他的身份；2）主体按“成绩—训练—品格”展开，What impresses me most is his modesty 以 what 从句作主语、谓语用单数 is，His story tells me... 中主语与谓语同样保持一致，主谓一致贯穿全篇；3）结尾 more than a great runner 呼应单元标题，并表明向他学习的决心，情感真挚。","highlight":"What impresses me most is his modesty.","highlightCn":"最让我印象深刻的是他的谦逊。"},"translation":null,"search":"我最敬佩的运动员苏炳添 su bingtian, the athlete i admire most among all the athletes i know, su bingtian is the one i admire most. people call him the fastest man in asia. in 2021, su bingtian ran 100 metres in 9.83 seconds at the tokyo olympics. to achieve this, he trained for many years. every day he got up early and practised running again and again. he never gave up when he was tired or hurt. because of his hard work, he broke the asian record and became a hero in china. what impresses me most is his modesty. he often says that his success belongs to the whole team, not only to himself. his story tells me that hard work always pays off. su bingtian is more than a great runner. he has set a good example for young people, and i will learn from him and keep working hard. 1）开篇用 among all the athletes i know... 引出我最敬佩的运动员苏炳添，并用 the fastest man in asia 点明他的身份；2）主体按“成绩—训练—品格”展开，what impresses me most is his modesty 以 what 从句作主语、谓语用单数 is，his story tells me... 中主语与谓语同样保持一致，主谓一致贯穿全篇；3）结尾 more than a great runner 呼应单元标题，并表明向他学习的决心，情感真挚。 what impresses me most is his modesty. 最让我印象深刻的是他的谦逊。"},{"id":"u8-a4","unit":8,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"不止是一场比赛","enTitle":"More than a Game","words":"约134词","wordsApprox":134,"paragraphs":["Last autumn, I took part in a five-kilometre run along the Tianfu Greenway. It was my first long-distance race, and I was both excited and nervous.","The race started at seven in the morning. After the first two kilometres, I was very tired and wanted to stop. Just at that moment, an old man running beside me smiled and told me not to give up. His words gave me strength. I kept running and finally crossed the finish line. While I was resting, I saw a girl helping a runner who had fallen down. Nobody laughed at him. Instead, everyone cheered for him.","These small moments made me understand that sports are more than a game. They teach us to help each other and never give up. That is the real meaning of sports."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇交代参加天府绿道五公里跑的经历，both excited and nervous 写出赛前心情，真实自然；2）主体按时间顺序推进：起跑吃力—老人鼓励—冲过终点—看到女孩扶起摔倒的选手，Everyone cheered for him 中 everyone 作主语、谓语用单数，Nobody laughed at him 同样体现主谓一致；3）结尾 These small moments made me understand that sports are more than a game 以复数主语搭配 made，点题升华，突出互助与坚持的体育精神。","highlight":"These small moments made me understand that sports are more than a game.","highlightCn":"这些小小的瞬间让我明白，体育不止是一场比赛。"},"translation":null,"search":"不止是一场比赛 more than a game last autumn, i took part in a five-kilometre run along the tianfu greenway. it was my first long-distance race, and i was both excited and nervous. the race started at seven in the morning. after the first two kilometres, i was very tired and wanted to stop. just at that moment, an old man running beside me smiled and told me not to give up. his words gave me strength. i kept running and finally crossed the finish line. while i was resting, i saw a girl helping a runner who had fallen down. nobody laughed at him. instead, everyone cheered for him. these small moments made me understand that sports are more than a game. they teach us to help each other and never give up. that is the real meaning of sports. 1）开篇交代参加天府绿道五公里跑的经历，both excited and nervous 写出赛前心情，真实自然；2）主体按时间顺序推进：起跑吃力—老人鼓励—冲过终点—看到女孩扶起摔倒的选手，everyone cheered for him 中 everyone 作主语、谓语用单数，nobody laughed at him 同样体现主谓一致；3）结尾 these small moments made me understand that sports are more than a game 以复数主语搭配 made，点题升华，突出互助与坚持的体育精神。 these small moments made me understand that sports are more than a game. 这些小小的瞬间让我明白，体育不止是一场比赛。"},{"id":"u8-a5","unit":8,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"北京奥运会，让世界了解中国","enTitle":"The Beijing Olympics, a Window to China","words":"约143词","wordsApprox":143,"paragraphs":["The 2008 Beijing Olympic Games were a great success. For the first time, China showed the whole world its long history and modern face.","Millions of people watched the opening ceremony on TV, and everyone was amazed by the wonderful performances. Chinese athletes won the most gold medals, which made the whole country proud. What moved me most was the spirit of the volunteers. They smiled and helped guests from all over the world, and their warm service won high praise. During the Games, the whole world learned more about China. Sports brought people together, and friendship was built between different countries.","The Olympic spirit of faster, higher, stronger and together lives on. The Beijing Olympics are more than a sporting event. They are a bridge between China and the world. Whenever I think of those days, I feel proud of my country."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开篇 The 2008 Beijing Olympic Games were a great success 以复数主语 Games 搭配 were，主谓一致准确，并直接点题；2）主体按“开幕式—运动员夺金—志愿者服务”展开，What moved me most was... 以 what 从句作主语、谓语用单数，Sports brought people together 与 friendship was built 单复数各得其宜，主谓一致贯穿全篇；3）结尾 lives on 以单数谓语搭配 the Olympic spirit，并把北京奥运会比作中国与世界之间的桥梁，主题升华自然。","highlight":"What moved me most was the spirit of the volunteers.","highlightCn":"最让我感动的是志愿者们的精神。"},"translation":null,"search":"北京奥运会，让世界了解中国 the beijing olympics, a window to china the 2008 beijing olympic games were a great success. for the first time, china showed the whole world its long history and modern face. millions of people watched the opening ceremony on tv, and everyone was amazed by the wonderful performances. chinese athletes won the most gold medals, which made the whole country proud. what moved me most was the spirit of the volunteers. they smiled and helped guests from all over the world, and their warm service won high praise. during the games, the whole world learned more about china. sports brought people together, and friendship was built between different countries. the olympic spirit of faster, higher, stronger and together lives on. the beijing olympics are more than a sporting event. they are a bridge between china and the world. whenever i think of those days, i feel proud of my country. 1）开篇 the 2008 beijing olympic games were a great success 以复数主语 games 搭配 were，主谓一致准确，并直接点题；2）主体按“开幕式—运动员夺金—志愿者服务”展开，what moved me most was... 以 what 从句作主语、谓语用单数，sports brought people together 与 friendship was built 单复数各得其宜，主谓一致贯穿全篇；3）结尾 lives on 以单数谓语搭配 the olympic spirit，并把北京奥运会比作中国与世界之间的桥梁，主题升华自然。 what moved me most was the spirit of the volunteers. 最让我感动的是志愿者们的精神。"},{"id":"u8-b1","unit":8,"group":"B","index":1,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"我们的学校运动会","enTitle":"Our School Sports Meeting","words":"约97词","wordsApprox":97,"paragraphs":["Last week, our school had a sports meeting. All the students were very excited.","There were many events, such as running, the long jump and the relay race. I took part in the 400-metre race. At first I was nervous, but my classmates cheered for me. I ran as fast as I could and got third place. Our class also won the relay race. Everyone in my class was very happy.","Sports are not only about winning. They teach us to work together and never give up. I hope our next sports meeting will be even better."],"analysis":null,"translation":"上周，我们学校举行了运动会。所有学生都非常兴奋。运动会有很多项目，比如跑步、跳远和接力赛。我参加了400米赛跑。一开始我很紧张，但同学们为我加油。我尽全力跑，获得了第三名。我们班还赢得了接力赛。我们班的每个人都非常高兴。体育不仅仅是为了获胜。它教会我们团结合作、永不放弃。我希望我们的下一届运动会会更好。","search":"我们的学校运动会 our school sports meeting last week, our school had a sports meeting. all the students were very excited. there were many events, such as running, the long jump and the relay race. i took part in the 400-metre race. at first i was nervous, but my classmates cheered for me. i ran as fast as i could and got third place. our class also won the relay race. everyone in my class was very happy. sports are not only about winning. they teach us to work together and never give up. i hope our next sports meeting will be even better. 上周，我们学校举行了运动会。所有学生都非常兴奋。运动会有很多项目，比如跑步、跳远和接力赛。我参加了400米赛跑。一开始我很紧张，但同学们为我加油。我尽全力跑，获得了第三名。我们班还赢得了接力赛。我们班的每个人都非常高兴。体育不仅仅是为了获胜。它教会我们团结合作、永不放弃。我希望我们的下一届运动会会更好。"},{"id":"u8-b2","unit":8,"group":"B","index":2,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"我最敬佩的运动员马龙","enTitle":"Ma Long, My Favourite Athlete","words":"约94词","wordsApprox":94,"paragraphs":["My favourite athlete is Ma Long. He is one of the best table tennis players in the world.","Ma Long started playing table tennis when he was young. He trained hard every day and never gave up. He has won many world championships and six Olympic gold medals. What I like most about him is his calmness. When he loses a point, he never gets angry but tries his best in the next one.","Ma Long is a real hero in my heart. I will learn from him and never give up my dream."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我最喜欢的运动员是马龙。他是世界上最优秀的乒乓球运动员之一。马龙很小的时候就开始打乒乓球。他每天刻苦训练，从不放弃。他多次获得世界冠军，还获得过六枚奥运会金牌。我最喜欢他的一点是他的沉着。当他丢了一分时，他从不生气，而是在下一分中尽全力。马龙是我心中真正的英雄。我要向他学习，永不放弃自己的梦想。","search":"我最敬佩的运动员马龙 ma long, my favourite athlete my favourite athlete is ma long. he is one of the best table tennis players in the world. ma long started playing table tennis when he was young. he trained hard every day and never gave up. he has won many world championships and six olympic gold medals. what i like most about him is his calmness. when he loses a point, he never gets angry but tries his best in the next one. ma long is a real hero in my heart. i will learn from him and never give up my dream. 我最喜欢的运动员是马龙。他是世界上最优秀的乒乓球运动员之一。马龙很小的时候就开始打乒乓球。他每天刻苦训练，从不放弃。他多次获得世界冠军，还获得过六枚奥运会金牌。我最喜欢他的一点是他的沉着。当他丢了一分时，他从不生气，而是在下一分中尽全力。马龙是我心中真正的英雄。我要向他学习，永不放弃自己的梦想。"},{"id":"u8-b3","unit":8,"group":"B","index":3,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"我最喜欢的运动","enTitle":"Basketball, My Favourite Sport","words":"约91词","wordsApprox":91,"paragraphs":["My favourite sport is basketball. Playing basketball with my friends is the happiest time of my week.","We play basketball on the playground after school every Wednesday. Basketball is good for our health, and it also teaches us teamwork. On the court, everyone has a place and every player matters. When we win, we cheer together. When we lose, we also learn something new. Our coach often says that working together is more important than winning.","Basketball makes me strong and happy. I will keep playing it and enjoy every game."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我最喜欢的运动是篮球。和朋友们一起打篮球是我一周中最快乐的时光。每周三放学后我们都在操场上打篮球。篮球对我们的健康有好处，它也教会我们团队合作。在球场上，每个人都有自己的位置，每个队员都很重要。我们赢了就一起欢呼，输了也能学到新东西。我们的教练常说，团结合作比取胜更重要。篮球让我强壮又快乐。我会坚持打篮球，享受每一场比赛。","search":"我最喜欢的运动 basketball, my favourite sport my favourite sport is basketball. playing basketball with my friends is the happiest time of my week. we play basketball on the playground after school every wednesday. basketball is good for our health, and it also teaches us teamwork. on the court, everyone has a place and every player matters. when we win, we cheer together. when we lose, we also learn something new. our coach often says that working together is more important than winning. basketball makes me strong and happy. i will keep playing it and enjoy every game. 我最喜欢的运动是篮球。和朋友们一起打篮球是我一周中最快乐的时光。每周三放学后我们都在操场上打篮球。篮球对我们的健康有好处，它也教会我们团队合作。在球场上，每个人都有自己的位置，每个队员都很重要。我们赢了就一起欢呼，输了也能学到新东西。我们的教练常说，团结合作比取胜更重要。篮球让我强壮又快乐。我会坚持打篮球，享受每一场比赛。"},{"id":"u8-b4","unit":8,"group":"B","index":4,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"一场难忘的比赛","enTitle":"An Unforgettable Race","words":"约102词","wordsApprox":102,"paragraphs":["Last month, I ran an 800-metre race at our school sports meeting. It was the most unforgettable race of my life.","I was afraid before the race, because I was not good at running. However, my classmates stood by the track and cheered for me. In the last 200 metres, I felt like I could not move on. But I remembered their words and kept running. Finally, I crossed the finish line. I did not win a prize, but I was proud of myself.","This race taught me that never giving up is a kind of victory. I will remember it forever."],"analysis":null,"translation":"上个月，我在学校运动会上跑了一场800米比赛。那是我一生中最难忘的一场比赛。比赛前我很害怕，因为我不擅长跑步。但是，同学们站在跑道边为我加油。在最后200米时，我觉得自己跑不动了。但我想起他们的话，继续坚持跑。最后，我冲过了终点线。我没有获奖，但我为自己感到骄傲。这场比赛教会我：永不放弃也是一种胜利。我会永远记住它。","search":"一场难忘的比赛 an unforgettable race last month, i ran an 800-metre race at our school sports meeting. it was the most unforgettable race of my life. i was afraid before the race, because i was not good at running. however, my classmates stood by the track and cheered for me. in the last 200 metres, i felt like i could not move on. but i remembered their words and kept running. finally, i crossed the finish line. i did not win a prize, but i was proud of myself. this race taught me that never giving up is a kind of victory. i will remember it forever. 上个月，我在学校运动会上跑了一场800米比赛。那是我一生中最难忘的一场比赛。比赛前我很害怕，因为我不擅长跑步。但是，同学们站在跑道边为我加油。在最后200米时，我觉得自己跑不动了。但我想起他们的话，继续坚持跑。最后，我冲过了终点线。我没有获奖，但我为自己感到骄傲。这场比赛教会我：永不放弃也是一种胜利。我会永远记住它。"},{"id":"u8-b5","unit":8,"group":"B","index":5,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"成都大运会","enTitle":"The Chengdu World University Games","words":"约99词","wordsApprox":99,"paragraphs":["In 2023, Chengdu held the World University Games. Many young athletes from different countries came to our city.","The Games were a big success. There were many exciting matches, and the whole city was full of energy. My family watched the opening ceremony on TV, and we were amazed by the wonderful show. My friends and I also visited Fenghuangshan Sports Park. The volunteers there were very friendly. They helped visitors and made everyone feel at home.","The Games have made Chengdu more beautiful. I am proud of my city, and I hope to see more sports events here."],"analysis":null,"translation":"2023年，成都举办了世界大学生运动会。许多来自不同国家的年轻运动员来到了我们这座城市。大运会取得了巨大成功。有许多激动人心的比赛，整座城市充满了活力。我和家人一起在电视上观看了开幕式，精彩的表演让我们惊叹不已。我和朋友们还参观了凤凰山体育公园。那里的志愿者非常友好。他们帮助游客，让每个人都感到像在家里一样。大运会已经让成都变得更加美丽。我为我的城市感到骄傲，我希望在这里看到更多体育赛事。","search":"成都大运会 the chengdu world university games in 2023, chengdu held the world university games. many young athletes from different countries came to our city. the games were a big success. there were many exciting matches, and the whole city was full of energy. my family watched the opening ceremony on tv, and we were amazed by the wonderful show. my friends and i also visited fenghuangshan sports park. the volunteers there were very friendly. they helped visitors and made everyone feel at home. the games have made chengdu more beautiful. i am proud of my city, and i hope to see more sports events here. 2023年，成都举办了世界大学生运动会。许多来自不同国家的年轻运动员来到了我们这座城市。大运会取得了巨大成功。有许多激动人心的比赛，整座城市充满了活力。我和家人一起在电视上观看了开幕式，精彩的表演让我们惊叹不已。我和朋友们还参观了凤凰山体育公园。那里的志愿者非常友好。他们帮助游客，让每个人都感到像在家里一样。大运会已经让成都变得更加美丽。我为我的城市感到骄傲，我希望在这里看到更多体育赛事。"}]}]};
